(3593794, 503624, 53147, '<td valign="top">Sorry about this comment. Not quite sure what it was from. I have a sneaking suspicion that my kid got on the computer whilst I was away. But now while I am here - I might as well go ahead and leave a critique club like comment. <br/> <br/>I really like the color and detail on the strawberry. Vibrant without being overly saturated. The layout of the triptych works well too. I guess my only real complaint is the total desat of whatver the strawberry is above in the main pic. If it is chocolate I would personally like to see the chocolate browns underneath. I think it would give the image a more complete feel. It would have balanced out the color of the strawberry well. As it is it leaves the image feelig a little flat, or maybe its just that it makes the strawberry just feel like its just hanging there. Overall though nice image and composition. <br/> <br/>Hope this makes up for the +- comment left previously. I apologize for that.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-07 15:51:13.</i></td>', 'Sorry about this comment. Not quite sure what it was from. I have a sneaking suspicion that my kid got on the computer whilst I was away. But now while I am here - I might as well go ahead and leave a critique club like comment.  I really like the color and detail on the strawberry. Vibrant without being overly saturated. The layout of the triptych works well too. I guess my only real complaint is the total desat of whatver the strawberry is above in the main pic. If it is chocolate I would personally like to see the chocolate browns underneath. I think it would give the image a more complete feel. It would have balanced out the color of the strawberry well. As it is it leaves the image feelig a little flat, or maybe its just that it makes the strawberry just feel like its just hanging there. Overall though nice image and composition.  Hope this makes up for the +- comment left previously. I apologize for that. Tim', '2007-04-30 01:13:50.000000', '2007-05-07 16:51:13.000000', 1),
