(3594308, 504810, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt but while you used the full width allowed this shot is too short to be appreciated fully. You could have "stacked" the images and been able to use a large panel for each one.</td>', 'I like the attempt but while you used the full width allowed this shot is too short to be appreciated fully. You could have "stacked" the images and been able to use a large panel for each one.', '2007-04-30 02:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594309, 503384, 34938, '<td valign="top">great 1950''s old world feel...awesome americana shot 8</td>', 'great 1950''s old world feel...awesome americana shot 8', '2007-04-30 02:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594314, 505034, 73747, '<td valign="top">Beautiful images... great color, crisp and well-focused.  Good triptych!</td>', 'Beautiful images... great color, crisp and well-focused.  Good triptych!', '2007-04-30 02:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594315, 504514, 66515, '<td valign="top">The thought behind a "different" triptych is apparent and certainly worth a try. However, because you are basically trying to convey motion, putting the shots side by side would have been more effective.</td>', 'The thought behind a "different" triptych is apparent and certainly worth a try. However, because you are basically trying to convey motion, putting the shots side by side would have been more effective.', '2007-04-30 02:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594316, 505108, 34938, '<td valign="top">great idea...nice colours and tectures...would look great as a print on the wall 8</td>', 'great idea...nice colours and tectures...would look great as a print on the wall 8', '2007-04-30 02:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594317, 504595, 60224, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I think I see 3 different stages here....but does it fit the challenge? Regardless...I like the shot a lot.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I think I see 3 different stages here....but does it fit the challenge? Regardless...I like the shot a lot.', '2007-04-30 02:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594318, 504322, 34938, '<td valign="top">fantastic...what a great idea...would make a great poster for the zoo 8</td>', 'fantastic...what a great idea...would make a great poster for the zoo 8', '2007-04-30 02:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594322, 501815, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this composition and the silhouetting of the runners is very effective.  If I was going to suggest any weaknesses I guess they would be to do with the symettry of the picture, It would have been nice to have lamposts and trees in either all three frames or just the central one (which from the fact that the mountain in the background runs evenly is I guess something you had no control over) Equally, I may have tried to go for just two runners in each frame.  Love the application of rule of thirds in terms of dark area at the bottom of the frame</td>', 'I love the colours in this composition and the silhouetting of the runners is very effective.  If I was going to suggest any weaknesses I guess they would be to do with the symettry of the picture, It would have been nice to have lamposts and trees in either all three frames or just the central one (which from the fact that the mountain in the background runs evenly is I guess something you had no control over) Equally, I may have tried to go for just two runners in each frame.  Love the application of rule of thirds in terms of dark area at the bottom of the frame', '2007-04-30 02:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594324, 504171, 39629, '<td valign="top">great colors only thing I dont like here is whatever it is flying off in the top shot.........7</td>', 'great colors only thing I dont like here is whatever it is flying off in the top shot.........7', '2007-04-30 02:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594327, 502986, 68035, '<td valign="top">A lovely triptych, great bokeh on the tongue which complements the dof on the nose and contrasts nicely with the fact that your central image has the grass sharply in focus</td>', 'A lovely triptych, great bokeh on the tongue which complements the dof on the nose and contrasts nicely with the fact that your central image has the grass sharply in focus', '2007-04-30 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594332, 504371, 73747, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp images... especially #3.  Middle photo seems chopped off and hard to identify.</td>', 'Nice sharp images... especially #3.  Middle photo seems chopped off and hard to identify.', '2007-04-30 02:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594334, 504710, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great dof on the main image, the blurring of the fingers on the top frame should be distracting but somehow isnt, It would have been nice if you could have captured some of the tree branches in the bottom image to maintain the symmetry of the three images.</td>', 'Great dof on the main image, the blurring of the fingers on the top frame should be distracting but somehow isnt, It would have been nice if you could have captured some of the tree branches in the bottom image to maintain the symmetry of the three images.', '2007-04-30 02:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594335, 505000, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of colours</td>', 'Excellent capture of colours', '2007-04-30 02:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594337, 504958, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. This is so very romantic. Each image could stand on it''s own. Great use of the wide angle/fisheye(?), it works well here. I think the slight desaturation of the two side panels was appropriate so that the main panel becomes the center of the story. All in all a wonderful piece. I''m certain the couple would be overjoyed with this. 10 and faved.</td>', 'Back to comment. This is so very romantic. Each image could stand on it''s own. Great use of the wide angle/fisheye(?), it works well here. I think the slight desaturation of the two side panels was appropriate so that the main panel becomes the center of the story. All in all a wonderful piece. I''m certain the couple would be overjoyed with this. 10 and faved.', '2007-04-30 02:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594338, 504262, 38930, '<td valign="top">Perfect</td>', 'Perfect', '2007-04-30 02:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594341, 504713, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great series of photos, I like the way that you have accentuated the subject by blurring the grass above it. The chest of the bird looks slightly blown out but I guess a subject like this does no hang around posing to allow you to play around with different settings</td>', 'Great series of photos, I like the way that you have accentuated the subject by blurring the grass above it. The chest of the bird looks slightly blown out but I guess a subject like this does no hang around posing to allow you to play around with different settings', '2007-04-30 02:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594345, 504708, 38930, '<td valign="top">I would love to live here!</td>', 'I would love to live here!', '2007-04-30 02:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594346, 505082, 73747, '<td valign="top">Is this just a single photo that is sectioned off?  It doesn''t seem to tell a story or show any progression.</td>', 'Is this just a single photo that is sectioned off?  It doesn''t seem to tell a story or show any progression.', '2007-04-30 02:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594347, 504928, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is great!  A was actually going to do my tryptich with pelecans also.  After seeing this entry, I''m glad I ended up with a different subject.  Very nice work!  High marks from me.</td>', 'This is great!  A was actually going to do my tryptich with pelecans also.  After seeing this entry, I''m glad I ended up with a different subject.  Very nice work!  High marks from me.', '2007-04-30 02:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594348, 504812, 38930, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and well executed!</td>', 'Cool idea and well executed!', '2007-04-30 02:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594353, 503456, 38930, '<td valign="top">There''s an arm coming from the middle and right hands (probably a good thing!) but for the photo would have been better to burn out...IMO</td>', 'There''s an arm coming from the middle and right hands (probably a good thing!) but for the photo would have been better to burn out...IMO', '2007-04-30 02:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594354, 504769, 73747, '<td valign="top">Creative and well done!  Focus is off a little on left image.  Feather seems a little out of place.</td>', 'Creative and well done!  Focus is off a little on left image.  Feather seems a little out of place.', '2007-04-30 02:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
