(3594374, 504549, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice captures. She has such a plesant way about her that radiates from this series.</td>', 'Nice captures. She has such a plesant way about her that radiates from this series.', '2007-04-30 03:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594378, 504322, 6804, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea!!!  10</td>', 'Awesome idea!!!  10', '2007-04-30 03:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594383, 504927, 73747, '<td valign="top">Great sequence!  Nice sharp well focused images.  Wonderful expressions.</td>', 'Great sequence!  Nice sharp well focused images.  Wonderful expressions.', '2007-04-30 03:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594386, 504174, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice work. That last photo makes me think this might be Gaby.</td>', 'Very nice work. That last photo makes me think this might be Gaby.', '2007-04-30 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594395, 504594, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular!  I love the richness of the tones here.  One little nag is the bitmapping of the hard diagonal lines.  This is a common problem that can usually be hidden with a spot brush type application of softness applied to the sides of the lines.  I hope that is of help to you.    9 from me.</td>', 'This is spectacular!  I love the richness of the tones here.  One little nag is the bitmapping of the hard diagonal lines.  This is a common problem that can usually be hidden with a spot brush type application of softness applied to the sides of the lines.  I hope that is of help to you.    9 from me.', '2007-04-30 03:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594397, 504123, 73747, '<td valign="top">Creative edges.  Good sequence.  Nice clear well-focused photos.</td>', 'Creative edges.  Good sequence.  Nice clear well-focused photos.', '2007-04-30 03:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594399, 504652, 65035, '<td valign="top">Very creative, the symmetry is beautiful as are the colours.</td>', 'Very creative, the symmetry is beautiful as are the colours.', '2007-04-30 03:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594401, 502995, 73747, '<td valign="top">Beautiful imagery!</td>', 'Beautiful imagery!', '2007-04-30 03:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594403, 503386, 65035, '<td valign="top">Funny how it''s the little things that count, the red bell ties in so beautifully with the gate and keeps me looking for more interesting details. Lovely.</td>', 'Funny how it''s the little things that count, the red bell ties in so beautifully with the gate and keeps me looking for more interesting details. Lovely.', '2007-04-30 03:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594407, 504171, 73747, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photos, vibrant colors! Only downside is the fuzzy something on the top photo just above the tree.  Maybe a bird?  I found it distracting.</td>', 'Nice sharp photos, vibrant colors! Only downside is the fuzzy something on the top photo just above the tree.  Maybe a bird?  I found it distracting.', '2007-04-30 03:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594409, 504828, 73747, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but it looks like a single photo chopped into three parts.</td>', 'Pretty, but it looks like a single photo chopped into three parts.', '2007-04-30 03:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594410, 504750, 52572, '<td valign="top">well edited and composed. well-done. r10</td>', 'well edited and composed. well-done. r10', '2007-04-30 03:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594416, 503329, 73747, '<td valign="top">The blurry flower in the first photo seems out-of-place... distracting.</td>', 'The blurry flower in the first photo seems out-of-place... distracting.', '2007-04-30 03:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594424, 504814, 73747, '<td valign="top">Nice sequence of photos... very charming.  The color seems a little dull though, which also happens to my photos.  They look good on my screen and then seem to dull up after I upload them.</td>', 'Nice sequence of photos... very charming.  The color seems a little dull though, which also happens to my photos.  They look good on my screen and then seem to dull up after I upload them.', '2007-04-30 03:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
