(3594506, 504396, 74533, '<td valign="top">would have been better if it was clearer</td>', 'would have been better if it was clearer', '2007-04-30 04:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594508, 505081, 67324, '<td valign="top">All beautiful imagery. But why are they together. It is all amazing but not complementary. IMHO.</td>', 'All beautiful imagery. But why are they together. It is all amazing but not complementary. IMHO.', '2007-04-30 04:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594510, 503635, 67324, '<td valign="top">From the picture one would assume he was a pilot. Good set otherwise.</td>', 'From the picture one would assume he was a pilot. Good set otherwise.', '2007-04-30 04:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594513, 504529, 68035, '<td valign="top">A stunning set of captures, the thrid one particularly is simply awesome.  Not quite sure how they work as a triptych, the one in the middle is a little distracting with what I presume is the pot of bird seed in the background (as is the lid in the left hand side) but to be honest the quality of the third one trumps all that</td>', 'A stunning set of captures, the thrid one particularly is simply awesome.  Not quite sure how they work as a triptych, the one in the middle is a little distracting with what I presume is the pot of bird seed in the background (as is the lid in the left hand side) but to be honest the quality of the third one trumps all that', '2007-04-30 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594515, 504833, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice heron series and well balanced, Im guessing you were zoomed in to the max here as there is a bit of a loss of sharpness/definition.  Top right image particularly impressive</td>', 'Very nice heron series and well balanced, Im guessing you were zoomed in to the max here as there is a bit of a loss of sharpness/definition.  Top right image particularly impressive', '2007-04-30 04:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594516, 502785, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great sequential shooting and very nicely balanced.  Great colour and sharpness.  Shame about the cones (dawn organisers dont they realise that you have work to do!).  The logo on the car is magnificent given the set of shots</td>', 'Great sequential shooting and very nicely balanced.  Great colour and sharpness.  Shame about the cones (dawn organisers dont they realise that you have work to do!).  The logo on the car is magnificent given the set of shots', '2007-04-30 04:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594521, 504718, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely set of portraits, bottom left is the standout shot.  Very nicely balanced</td>', 'Lovely set of portraits, bottom left is the standout shot.  Very nicely balanced', '2007-04-30 04:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594527, 505043, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow what a wonderful triptych, every image could stand alone as a composition, in this format the overall impact is breathtaking</td>', 'Wow what a wonderful triptych, every image could stand alone as a composition, in this format the overall impact is breathtaking', '2007-04-30 04:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594528, 504652, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love what you have done with this triptych, there could be an argument that the subject isnt - it itself - that ''interesting'' but in this format for  me I think it works</td>', 'I love what you have done with this triptych, there could be an argument that the subject isnt - it itself - that ''interesting'' but in this format for  me I think it works', '2007-04-30 04:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594536, 503386, 41337, '<td valign="top">You seem to have captured the essense of a cat quite well here.</td>', 'You seem to have captured the essense of a cat quite well here.', '2007-04-30 04:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594540, 504194, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic triptych, I am not a bit superbikes fan but even I can see the beauty in what you have created, I reckon any Biaggi fan would absolutely love this on their wall.  Great colour, great capture, great colours, great composition.  Hell let me just save some time and say GREAT</td>', 'What a fantastic triptych, I am not a bit superbikes fan but even I can see the beauty in what you have created, I reckon any Biaggi fan would absolutely love this on their wall.  Great colour, great capture, great colours, great composition.  Hell let me just save some time and say GREAT', '2007-04-30 04:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594542, 503789, 41337, '<td valign="top">Quite unique!</td>', 'Quite unique!', '2007-04-30 04:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594548, 504904, 68035, '<td valign="top">Brillant capture, you have used triptych to maximum effect, it deserves to be a poster/postcard</td>', 'Brillant capture, you have used triptych to maximum effect, it deserves to be a poster/postcard', '2007-04-30 04:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594559, 503341, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this triptych and the colours you have used in each frame are wonderfully complementary.  Would not look out of place on anyones wall<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this triptych and the colours you have used in each frame are wonderfully complementary.  Would not look out of place on anyones wall Good job', '2007-04-30 04:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594565, 504288, 68035, '<td valign="top">There are so many great images in this challenge, and this is definitely one of them, made me gasp when I saw it and I love the way you have used the medium of triptych to maximum effect<br/> <br/>I raise my hat to you</td>', 'There are so many great images in this challenge, and this is definitely one of them, made me gasp when I saw it and I love the way you have used the medium of triptych to maximum effect I raise my hat to you', '2007-04-30 04:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594567, 505101, 41337, '<td valign="top">Too bad the rooster doesn''t have it''s mouth open. That would have complimented the cow''s eyes and the pigs ears better but still very amusing!</td>', 'Too bad the rooster doesn''t have it''s mouth open. That would have complimented the cow''s eyes and the pigs ears better but still very amusing!', '2007-04-30 04:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594571, 503620, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2007-04-30 04:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
