(3595682, 504251, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great color, lighting and focus.  However, if I didn''t know in advance what challenge this is I''d have no idea this is supposed to be a Triptych.</td>', 'Great color, lighting and focus.  However, if I didn''t know in advance what challenge this is I''d have no idea this is supposed to be a Triptych.', '2007-04-30 12:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
