(3595691, 504927, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion and moment captured here.  Not sure about the choice of sizing the various 3 images, but overall it works ok.</td>', 'Love the emotion and moment captured here.  Not sure about the choice of sizing the various 3 images, but overall it works ok.', '2007-04-30 12:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595696, 504398, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nicely done Triptych with the use of one photo and various levels of PP to get the Triptych look and feel.  The color of the tulip jumps out after the blue and greys (which work well together also BTW).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done Triptych with the use of one photo and various levels of PP to get the Triptych look and feel.  The color of the tulip jumps out after the blue and greys (which work well together also BTW).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-30 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595699, 504891, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well seen and composed.  The broody sky works well and the B/W toning is right on the mark.  Nice job!</td>', 'Well seen and composed.  The broody sky works well and the B/W toning is right on the mark.  Nice job!', '2007-04-30 12:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595700, 504529, 39632, '<td valign="top">neat</td>', 'neat', '2007-04-30 12:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595704, 504396, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ha I laughed out loud at the fact you said that someone had told you to change your model...Ignore them!!  The ones on the outside are fine its just the one in the middle that is a gargoyle!!! (That''s a JOKE!!!!!!!)<br/> <br/>Great colours and a lovely triptych, only tweak i might have made wou;ld have been to size the right frame so that her head was below yours when you look at the trip in its entirety<br/> <br/>Nice PP, especially the clouds<br/> <br/>Jon</td>', 'Ha I laughed out loud at the fact you said that someone had told you to change your model...Ignore them!!  The ones on the outside are fine its just the one in the middle that is a gargoyle!!! (That''s a JOKE!!!!!!!) Great colours and a lovely triptych, only tweak i might have made wou;ld have been to size the right frame so that her head was below yours when you look at the trip in its entirety Nice PP, especially the clouds Jon', '2007-04-30 12:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595708, 503954, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice package of images.  All of them could stand on their own quite well and they work together as a package also.  Great job!</td>', 'Nice package of images.  All of them could stand on their own quite well and they work together as a package also.  Great job!', '2007-04-30 12:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595709, 505036, 39632, '<td valign="top">I think the triptych format distracts from an otherwise nicely captured photo.</td>', 'I think the triptych format distracts from an otherwise nicely captured photo.', '2007-04-30 12:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595710, 504327, 64929, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  Very nice shot!  *7*</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  Very nice shot!  *7*', '2007-04-30 12:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595713, 503328, 32084, '<td valign="top">Bird shots are very tough and I personally learned this from getting hammered on other sites.  I am not saying I ever got any good at these, but what was shared with me is that the whites on birds are key are are easy to overexpose.  One should be able to see the feather details in the white areas.  Also, and eye glint is almost a nessitiy in all close up bird shots.  I like what you have done and hopefully you will find some of this info helpful in future shots.</td>', 'Bird shots are very tough and I personally learned this from getting hammered on other sites.  I am not saying I ever got any good at these, but what was shared with me is that the whites on birds are key are are easy to overexpose.  One should be able to see the feather details in the white areas.  Also, and eye glint is almost a nessitiy in all close up bird shots.  I like what you have done and hopefully you will find some of this info helpful in future shots.', '2007-04-30 12:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595714, 503386, 64929, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites from the challenge!  Great work....it''s so "cat!" *9*</td>', 'One of my favorites from the challenge!  Great work....it''s so "cat!" *9*', '2007-04-30 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
