(3596660, 504171, 65234, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential; great color and light, and each frame stands pretty well on its own as well as together compositionally.  The bird/bee/flying thing and light-colored stalks behind the poppies are very distracting to me in the top panel, as is the little speck on the upper right in the left-bottom panel.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential; great color and light, and each frame stands pretty well on its own as well as together compositionally.  The bird/bee/flying thing and light-colored stalks behind the poppies are very distracting to me in the top panel, as is the little speck on the upper right in the left-bottom panel.', '2007-04-30 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596667, 505110, 65234, '<td valign="top">Could be an optical illusion, but the panels appear to be the same size but not aligned horizontally.  Also feels a little off-balance with 2 balls almost but not quite the same size and the third much larger.</td>', 'Could be an optical illusion, but the panels appear to be the same size but not aligned horizontally.  Also feels a little off-balance with 2 balls almost but not quite the same size and the third much larger.', '2007-04-30 17:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596682, 504262, 47541, '<td valign="top">I like the way the red tulip is there to contrast with the yellow - it lifts the whole set from being "dull yellow flowers" to having some actual interest.  Same with the sunburst in the top</td>', 'I like the way the red tulip is there to contrast with the yellow - it lifts the whole set from being "dull yellow flowers" to having some actual interest.  Same with the sunburst in the top', '2007-04-30 17:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596685, 504805, 19944, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would have moved the far right image to the far left, the left image to the center and the center to the right.  That way, it gives more of a sense of progression...standing still, lifting off, then full flight.  Also, the coloring of the left image doesn''t seem to match the other two.  Otherwise, they are all very nice, sharp captures.</td>', 'Personally, I would have moved the far right image to the far left, the left image to the center and the center to the right.  That way, it gives more of a sense of progression...standing still, lifting off, then full flight.  Also, the coloring of the left image doesn''t seem to match the other two.  Otherwise, they are all very nice, sharp captures.', '2007-04-30 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596686, 504251, 19944, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure about that big red border, but the lighting on the flowers is nice.</td>', 'I''m not really sure about that big red border, but the lighting on the flowers is nice.', '2007-04-30 17:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596688, 504595, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice transitions, it is hard to see where you have joined the images.  Good idea too</td>', 'Nice transitions, it is hard to see where you have joined the images.  Good idea too', '2007-04-30 17:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596692, 503789, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the same picture at 3 different times of day.  But the arrangement invites comparison in size and positioning and the building lines in the panels don''t all match up.</td>', 'I like the idea of the same picture at 3 different times of day.  But the arrangement invites comparison in size and positioning and the building lines in the panels don''t all match up.', '2007-04-30 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596694, 504295, 42181, '<td valign="top">Lovely looking picture, shame about the two white lines.</td>', 'Lovely looking picture, shame about the two white lines.', '2007-04-30 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596696, 502662, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like that you have the photos in a directional order, but i think that it would be more effecting if the whole thing were flipped vertically, so that the heron flys from left to right.  Since the eye 9or at least my eye) moves left to right, this just seems confusing.  Otherwise, each photo is very nice and sharp.  Herons are a hard capture.  They always seem to know the camera is out and go away.</td>', 'I like that you have the photos in a directional order, but i think that it would be more effecting if the whole thing were flipped vertically, so that the heron flys from left to right.  Since the eye 9or at least my eye) moves left to right, this just seems confusing.  Otherwise, each photo is very nice and sharp.  Herons are a hard capture.  They always seem to know the camera is out and go away.', '2007-04-30 17:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596705, 504951, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really like how you let the photos overlap the border.  That ties the panels together really well, and the obvious continuity of action is strengthened nicely.</td>', 'Really like how you let the photos overlap the border.  That ties the panels together really well, and the obvious continuity of action is strengthened nicely.', '2007-04-30 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596707, 503386, 19944, '<td valign="top">Since the eye (or at least my eye) generally moves left to right, I think switching the left and right images would have worked better.  In other words, have the cat ''leaving'' from the right side of the triptych.  As it is, the cat is jumping ''into'' it.  Nice pics otherwise, and a great action shot of it jumping through the gate.</td>', 'Since the eye (or at least my eye) generally moves left to right, I think switching the left and right images would have worked better.  In other words, have the cat ''leaving'' from the right side of the triptych.  As it is, the cat is jumping ''into'' it.  Nice pics otherwise, and a great action shot of it jumping through the gate.', '2007-04-30 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596709, 504291, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute and original idea.  It''s been an eternity since I heard that song ;-)</td>', 'Cute and original idea.  It''s been an eternity since I heard that song ;-)', '2007-04-30 17:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596710, 503786, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice, I just wish the right hand "box" included her hand so the images all felt linked together better, 6</td>', 'Nice, I just wish the right hand "box" included her hand so the images all felt linked together better, 6', '2007-04-30 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596714, 504871, 45375, '<td valign="top">nice idea...i really like the kid reading the memorial to tie it together</td>', 'nice idea...i really like the kid reading the memorial to tie it together', '2007-04-30 17:31:43.000000', NULL, 1);
