(3596725, 504148, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a differnta layout, however the subject matter is rather boring (to me) and the top image looks slightly distorted. 6</td>', 'Nice to see a differnta layout, however the subject matter is rather boring (to me) and the top image looks slightly distorted. 6', '2007-04-30 17:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
