(3596828, 504554, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK. I will try to be constructive here as much as possible.<br/> <br/>The imags are initially poorly executed. The background would of been better if it had been plain instead of using a curtain with folds. it makes it look very amateurish.<br/>Next, the lighting doesnt really work, too red? poor white balance? not quite sure.<br/>OK, the angle of the 2 side panel shots doesnt do it justice. You are shooting from slightly below. headhight would of been an improvement.<br/> <br/>However, the general concept is good, but it would of been better if you could of used a model of sorts (a friend? relative?) I think I know who is in the shot and if you are who I think you are, I know you are capable of much better work than this.  sorry, but its a 4.<br/> <br/>(probaly the longest commen you have received this challenge I''d imagine!)</td>', 'OK. I will try to be constructive here as much as possible. The imags are initially poorly executed. The background would of been better if it had been plain instead of using a curtain with folds. it makes it look very amateurish.Next, the lighting doesnt really work, too red? poor white balance? not quite sure.OK, the angle of the 2 side panel shots doesnt do it justice. You are shooting from slightly below. headhight would of been an improvement. However, the general concept is good, but it would of been better if you could of used a model of sorts (a friend? relative?) I think I know who is in the shot and if you are who I think you are, I know you are capable of much better work than this.  sorry, but its a 4. (probaly the longest commen you have received this challenge I''d imagine!)', '2007-04-30 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596832, 504150, 3746, '<td valign="top">magical... in my opinion, out of what I have seen, this could be a ribbon.. I love it, adding to favourites. first 10 of the challenge for me.. would love to know whose it is.. a big fat 10 all the way.. well done &amp; thanks for sharing!</td>', 'magical... in my opinion, out of what I have seen, this could be a ribbon.. I love it, adding to favourites. first 10 of the challenge for me.. would love to know whose it is.. a big fat 10 all the way.. well done & thanks for sharing!', '2007-04-30 18:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596836, 504863, 3746, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOD.. amazing, one of the best on DPC in a long time. 10 and congrats on the ribbon. adding to faves. thanks for sharing.</td>', 'OH MY GOD.. amazing, one of the best on DPC in a long time. 10 and congrats on the ribbon. adding to faves. thanks for sharing.', '2007-04-30 18:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596839, 505036, 3746, '<td valign="top">Umm, nice picture, but just spliiting a single image into 3 really doesnt strikeme as classic triptych.  amazing image on its own, but thats half the problem. it is on its own.</td>', 'Umm, nice picture, but just spliiting a single image into 3 really doesnt strikeme as classic triptych.  amazing image on its own, but thats half the problem. it is on its own.', '2007-04-30 18:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
