(3596956, 505001, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, bear with me on this one.<br/> <br/>As I am voting, I am giving most images about 5 secs of my time then move onto the next (as long as I am not typing a comment).. Then I get to this one. I almost hit 6. then pause.<br/> <br/>and look again<br/> <br/>and study it.<br/> <br/>Its a bizarre series of shots. its funny, its disturbing, its just so darn good.. RARELY do I stop on a photo to study it for any length of time, but this one just makes me want to look at it.  <br/> <br/>and look at it some more.<br/> <br/>Kudos to your model. he has nailed some real great poses. You can alsmot hear some politician spouting his rhetoric.<br/> <br/>I truely hope this does well, to think I was going to give this a 6 and no comment..<br/> <br/>10. all the way. I love it. adding to faves. (and a nice long comment to boot! we all like getting comments during the voting period dont we). I really really hope this makes the frontpage. feel free to PM me as I would love to know who shot this.</td>', 'OK, bear with me on this one. As I am voting, I am giving most images about 5 secs of my time then move onto the next (as long as I am not typing a comment).. Then I get to this one. I almost hit 6. then pause. and look again and study it. Its a bizarre series of shots. its funny, its disturbing, its just so darn good.. RARELY do I stop on a photo to study it for any length of time, but this one just makes me want to look at it.   and look at it some more. Kudos to your model. he has nailed some real great poses. You can alsmot hear some politician spouting his rhetoric. I truely hope this does well, to think I was going to give this a 6 and no comment.. 10. all the way. I love it. adding to faves. (and a nice long comment to boot! we all like getting comments during the voting period dont we). I really really hope this makes the frontpage. feel free to PM me as I would love to know who shot this.', '2007-04-30 18:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
