(3597055, 502066, 70369, '<td valign="top">Each of the photo''s have very busy backgrounds and this image probably would have worked better for me if you used a large aperature and blurred out everything but the actual flowers.</td>', 'Each of the photo''s have very busy backgrounds and this image probably would have worked better for me if you used a large aperature and blurred out everything but the actual flowers.', '2007-04-30 19:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597061, 504147, 70369, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit flat. I look for bright whites and the parts that should be dark, need to be really dark.. A touch of curves would have made a big difference or playing with the brightness &amp; contrast. IMHO</td>', 'The colors are a bit flat. I look for bright whites and the parts that should be dark, need to be really dark.. A touch of curves would have made a big difference or playing with the brightness & contrast. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597063, 504050, 70369, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea here. I think the fact that they aren''t in sharp focus really takes away from this. Also, the middle image should have their heads level with the two on the sides. The color change in each is very pretty &amp; would have been more then enough to separate all three.</td>', 'I really like your idea here. I think the fact that they aren''t in sharp focus really takes away from this. Also, the middle image should have their heads level with the two on the sides. The color change in each is very pretty & would have been more then enough to separate all three.', '2007-04-30 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597072, 501958, 70369, '<td valign="top">I love natural lighting normally, but these all seem a bit too dark. Maybe if it had a tighter crop on all three, so their faces were more the subject, then it would have worked better for me.</td>', 'I love natural lighting normally, but these all seem a bit too dark. Maybe if it had a tighter crop on all three, so their faces were more the subject, then it would have worked better for me.', '2007-04-30 19:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597080, 505010, 70369, '<td valign="top">I would have really liked to see some interesting angles here. Especially for a statue, since it''s you know, not doing anything.. They kinda need a bit more to make them seem interesting.. IMHO.</td>', 'I would have really liked to see some interesting angles here. Especially for a statue, since it''s you know, not doing anything.. They kinda need a bit more to make them seem interesting.. IMHO.', '2007-04-30 19:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597085, 502570, 70369, '<td valign="top">The shot in the middle is lost in the highlights of the background.. I think all 3 shots would look really good with a large aperature so they are the focus and the background is lost all together. IMHO</td>', 'The shot in the middle is lost in the highlights of the background.. I think all 3 shots would look really good with a large aperature so they are the focus and the background is lost all together. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597087, 503333, 70369, '<td valign="top">This would have been realloy powerful if it was in focus. IMHO</td>', 'This would have been realloy powerful if it was in focus. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597106, 504117, 70369, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the blue framing here. I think maybe brightening the image, up''ing the contrast a touch and splitting it up in 3 frames using a white border would have made it better for me. IMHO.. :-)</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the blue framing here. I think maybe brightening the image, up''ing the contrast a touch and splitting it up in 3 frames using a white border would have made it better for me. IMHO.. :-)', '2007-04-30 19:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597107, 504842, 70369, '<td valign="top">I would have really liked to see the larger picture in sharp focus, like the top one. And, I think a different color background would have really helped this too since the backdrop is in white. Detail gets lost in the top picture as it blends easily with the white background. IMHO</td>', 'I would have really liked to see the larger picture in sharp focus, like the top one. And, I think a different color background would have really helped this too since the backdrop is in white. Detail gets lost in the top picture as it blends easily with the white background. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597115, 504265, 70369, '<td valign="top">These are great captures. I think if you bumped up the saturation &amp; contrast a bit, it would have really made the images pop.</td>', 'These are great captures. I think if you bumped up the saturation & contrast a bit, it would have really made the images pop.', '2007-04-30 19:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597119, 503138, 70369, '<td valign="top">Shooting a fish tank is really hard. Nothin stays still and you usually have to bump up the ISO to get vibrant images. These didn''t really work for me only because it seems nothing is in focus. IMHO</td>', 'Shooting a fish tank is really hard. Nothin stays still and you usually have to bump up the ISO to get vibrant images. These didn''t really work for me only because it seems nothing is in focus. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597122, 504777, 70369, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and your style for separating each image. Only thing for me is this really isn''t an interesting capture. IMHO (unless, you have a foot fetish of course. :-)</td>', 'I like the colors and your style for separating each image. Only thing for me is this really isn''t an interesting capture. IMHO (unless, you have a foot fetish of course. :-)', '2007-04-30 19:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
