(3597133, 505100, 70369, '<td valign="top">hmm, nice colors.. My only thing here is the subject. Pictures of a statue are really tough for me only because they aren''t doing anything. It takes a lot to make them interesting. IMHO</td>', 'hmm, nice colors.. My only thing here is the subject. Pictures of a statue are really tough for me only because they aren''t doing anything. It takes a lot to make them interesting. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
