(3597136, 504551, 70369, '<td valign="top">I think if you bumped up the saturation &amp; contrast on this, it would have made the images pop more. The brown background is also a bit distracting. It doesn''t really pull any color from the images or enhance them. I think a black or white would have made a big difference. IMHO</td>', 'I think if you bumped up the saturation & contrast on this, it would have made the images pop more. The brown background is also a bit distracting. It doesn''t really pull any color from the images or enhance them. I think a black or white would have made a big difference. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597145, 501668, 70369, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred all images have their background blurred by use of aperature. It''s a little overwhelming to the eye to see such extreme differences from one image to the next. IMHO</td>', 'I think I would have preferred all images have their background blurred by use of aperature. It''s a little overwhelming to the eye to see such extreme differences from one image to the next. IMHO', '2007-04-30 19:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
