(3597600, 504260, 7485, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done and lovely over-all, but not very compelling. The left panel''s subject is excellent but the composition is not great, with the foreground tree taking too much attention. The swan just missed it''s light, and the lower right panel is pretty but a bit subtle.</td>', 'Technically very well done and lovely over-all, but not very compelling. The left panel''s subject is excellent but the composition is not great, with the foreground tree taking too much attention. The swan just missed it''s light, and the lower right panel is pretty but a bit subtle.', '2007-04-30 21:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
