(3597646, 504768, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and I particularly like how you got three subtly different plain backgrounds. But the dodging on the body in the large panel is far too obvious.</td>', 'Interesting subject, and I particularly like how you got three subtly different plain backgrounds. But the dodging on the body in the large panel is far too obvious.', '2007-04-30 21:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597647, 505094, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks like a happy dog.  A few suggestions:  the lighting seems quite different in the center panel, which leads my eye to the grass instead of the dog.  The bit of building in the left panel is distracting when the other panels have pure grass background.  Lastly, part of the dog is cut off in both the sitting and standing views; I think they would be better as full body views or head shots, but not this in-between-type view.</td>', 'He looks like a happy dog.  A few suggestions:  the lighting seems quite different in the center panel, which leads my eye to the grass instead of the dog.  The bit of building in the left panel is distracting when the other panels have pure grass background.  Lastly, part of the dog is cut off in both the sitting and standing views; I think they would be better as full body views or head shots, but not this in-between-type view.', '2007-04-30 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3597649, 505071, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lol. Both funny and charming.</td>', 'Lol. Both funny and charming.', '2007-04-30 21:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
