(3597983, 503410, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. At first, I couldn''t initially see that this was a triptych as opposed to one long scene. However, now that I''ve had a better look I can see it. The reason I missed it the first time I think, is the fact that the colour seems dull and flat. Problem with contrast perhaps? It''s a creative piece and I love that sign, but if you''re scoring low, I''d say it''s because of the contrast.</td>', 'Back to comment. At first, I couldn''t initially see that this was a triptych as opposed to one long scene. However, now that I''ve had a better look I can see it. The reason I missed it the first time I think, is the fact that the colour seems dull and flat. Problem with contrast perhaps? It''s a creative piece and I love that sign, but if you''re scoring low, I''d say it''s because of the contrast.', '2007-04-30 22:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
