(3598033, 503399, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  This is one of my top 6 in the challenge.  Great colours.  Nice POV on the shots.  This would be a 10 but the middle shot somehow doesn''t feel quite right with the two side images so I''m giving it a 9.  Maybe it''s the fact we see some background?  Maybe it''s because it isn''t a macro like the other two?<br/> <br/>If this doesn''t ribbon then it will be top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Great shot.  This is one of my top 6 in the challenge.  Great colours.  Nice POV on the shots.  This would be a 10 but the middle shot somehow doesn''t feel quite right with the two side images so I''m giving it a 9.  Maybe it''s the fact we see some background?  Maybe it''s because it isn''t a macro like the other two? If this doesn''t ribbon then it will be top 10 for sure.', '2007-04-30 22:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
