(3598133, 502872, 7485, '<td valign="top">The panel on the right is superb, with her piercing stare and powerful pose. Unfortunately the other two panels don''t quite live up to that one. The left panel shows a lovely pose, but her hand needs more light to stand out better. The pose in the middle panel is just too static. 10 for the right panel, 8 for the triptych as a whole.</td>', 'The panel on the right is superb, with her piercing stare and powerful pose. Unfortunately the other two panels don''t quite live up to that one. The left panel shows a lovely pose, but her hand needs more light to stand out better. The pose in the middle panel is just too static. 10 for the right panel, 8 for the triptych as a whole.', '2007-04-30 22:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
