(3598236, 503612, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. Interesting subject for a triptych. I like the layout. I feel that having the smaller panels on the left, really helps the flow of the story. Just seems to be lacking something. Maybe more vibrant blues or greens? Something to make it jump out, know what I mean? Technically, all three images have great exposure and are perfectly in focus. It just needs more... pizzazz...</td>', 'Back to comment. Interesting subject for a triptych. I like the layout. I feel that having the smaller panels on the left, really helps the flow of the story. Just seems to be lacking something. Maybe more vibrant blues or greens? Something to make it jump out, know what I mean? Technically, all three images have great exposure and are perfectly in focus. It just needs more... pizzazz...', '2007-04-30 23:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
