(3598279, 504595, 46336, '<td valign="top">A very different idea - had me thinking for a second. I hope everyone gets it. The general effect would have been helped by a more ''night'', as it is it looks to me like 20% night and 80% day.</td>', 'A very different idea - had me thinking for a second. I hope everyone gets it. The general effect would have been helped by a more ''night'', as it is it looks to me like 20% night and 80% day.', '2007-04-30 23:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
