(3598312, 504300, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. The title cracks me up. Takes me back to the days my older brother would take me fishing. He''d say that all the time :) I like the layout and the colours really pack a punch. I think the lighting on the bottom and the right panels, is a bit harsh though. But great, fun subject matter. Nice work!</td>', 'Back to comment. The title cracks me up. Takes me back to the days my older brother would take me fishing. He''d say that all the time :) I like the layout and the colours really pack a punch. I think the lighting on the bottom and the right panels, is a bit harsh though. But great, fun subject matter. Nice work!', '2007-04-30 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
