(3599040, 503399, 60862, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Just gorgeous - the shots, the sizing, the framing, all of it.  Colors, too.  Best shot I''ve seen so far.<br/> <br/>My 4th-grade daughter just had a test on the parts of the flower.  I''ll see what she recognizes. :)</td>', 'WOW.  Just gorgeous - the shots, the sizing, the framing, all of it.  Colors, too.  Best shot I''ve seen so far. My 4th-grade daughter just had a test on the parts of the flower.  I''ll see what she recognizes. :)', '2007-05-01 01:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599041, 504050, 60701, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of the image on the right because it makes it very moody, but I''d like to see the two on the left brighter since the subjects are looking at the camera but you can''t really see any detail.</td>', 'I like the darkness of the image on the right because it makes it very moody, but I''d like to see the two on the left brighter since the subjects are looking at the camera but you can''t really see any detail.', '2007-05-01 01:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
