(3599119, 502994, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - I think I would have preferred all colour though.</td>', 'Great set - I think I would have preferred all colour though.', '2007-05-01 02:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599120, 504863, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Wonderful tones and lighting - Great job.</td>', 'Great set - Wonderful tones and lighting - Great job.', '2007-05-01 02:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599125, 505060, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, THAT is an out of the box entry.  I like the creative framing a lot.  Very nice way to show a family holding onto itself.  The individual shots are very grainy, which I''m sure you intended, but I''m rarely a big fan.  Nonetheless, I''m giving this an 8.</td>', 'Well, THAT is an out of the box entry.  I like the creative framing a lot.  Very nice way to show a family holding onto itself.  The individual shots are very grainy, which I''m sure you intended, but I''m rarely a big fan.  Nonetheless, I''m giving this an 8.', '2007-05-01 02:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599127, 504927, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Has more of a personal appeal though</td>', 'Great set - Has more of a personal appeal though', '2007-05-01 02:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599130, 504326, 57378, '<td valign="top">I think more saturation could have worked.</td>', 'I think more saturation could have worked.', '2007-05-01 02:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599134, 503456, 60862, '<td valign="top">Duuuuuude. ;)  Interesting choice.  I like how the middle one''s bigger.</td>', 'Duuuuuude. ;)  Interesting choice.  I like how the middle one''s bigger.', '2007-05-01 02:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599138, 505086, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Nice crisp lighting but maybe not the best choice of setting out.</td>', 'Great set - Nice crisp lighting but maybe not the best choice of setting out.', '2007-05-01 02:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599142, 504787, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Like the colours a lot.</td>', 'Great set - Like the colours a lot.', '2007-05-01 02:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599143, 505111, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting editing!  After looking for a bit, I think I like your choice to put the darkest sky in the middle, as opposed to having it go from dark to light or vice versa as you move across the frame.</td>', 'Interesting editing!  After looking for a bit, I think I like your choice to put the darkest sky in the middle, as opposed to having it go from dark to light or vice versa as you move across the frame.', '2007-05-01 02:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599146, 502116, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the shots.  I think I''d prefer the triptych arrangement if it told a continuous story.  Given the title, I expected the bottom one to be the most free of the three.</td>', 'I like the idea and the shots.  I think I''d prefer the triptych arrangement if it told a continuous story.  Given the title, I expected the bottom one to be the most free of the three.', '2007-05-01 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599147, 505049, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Good job for picking an unusual subject. :) I like the curve they make together, too.</td>', 'Funny!  Good job for picking an unusual subject. :) I like the curve they make together, too.', '2007-05-01 02:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
