(3599189, 504576, 46336, '<td valign="top">This flows beautifully from image to image. I really like the story here. Only complaint is thaat I would have liked the two smaller images to have the same dimensions. Nonetheless a great shot.</td>', 'This flows beautifully from image to image. I really like the story here. Only complaint is thaat I would have liked the two smaller images to have the same dimensions. Nonetheless a great shot.', '2007-05-01 02:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
