(3599594, 504847, 36133, '<td valign="top">Isn''t she supposed to bite his head off afterwards?</td>', 'Isn''t she supposed to bite his head off afterwards?', '2007-05-01 12:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599681, 504173, 19944, '<td valign="top">Tim &amp; Amy, but whose is it?  Who cares?  It''s great!<br/> <br/>Where can I get me one of those hats?</td>', 'Tim & Amy, but whose is it?  Who cares?  It''s great! Where can I get me one of those hats?', '2007-05-01 12:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599731, 504117, 3746, '<td valign="top">This truely is a masterpiece, the blue frame is exquisite. The image is perfectly in focus and not poorly contrasting. I like the way the delicate sky blue border marrs the essential beauty of this mighty steed.<br/>10<br/> <br/>happy now??</td>', 'This truely is a masterpiece, the blue frame is exquisite. The image is perfectly in focus and not poorly contrasting. I like the way the delicate sky blue border marrs the essential beauty of this mighty steed.10 happy now??', '2007-05-01 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599766, 503971, 18219, '<td valign="top">I like the color portion and i like the unique take you have on the theme.<br/>but i do think the black and white portion is lacking a little punch.<br/>i know it''s not the major part of the image, but it sticks out to me.</td>', 'I like the color portion and i like the unique take you have on the theme.but i do think the black and white portion is lacking a little punch.i know it''s not the major part of the image, but it sticks out to me.', '2007-05-01 13:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599771, 503410, 18219, '<td valign="top">the colors are very muted.<br/>they don''t have any "punch" to them.</td>', 'the colors are very muted.they don''t have any "punch" to them.', '2007-05-01 13:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599785, 501651, 18219, '<td valign="top">an interesting arrangement.<br/>it''s not all that exciting to me though.<br/>but then again, i''m not a musician!!!!<br/>good luck anyway.</td>', 'an interesting arrangement.it''s not all that exciting to me though.but then again, i''m not a musician!!!!good luck anyway.', '2007-05-01 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599803, 504794, 56243, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t leave a comment when I vote high but I wanted to let you know i love the way you framed this.  It''s definatly something I wouldn''t have thought of and very creative!!!  Each one being a different size helps make the eye look at each individual photo as well as the whole.</td>', 'I normally don''t leave a comment when I vote high but I wanted to let you know i love the way you framed this.  It''s definatly something I wouldn''t have thought of and very creative!!!  Each one being a different size helps make the eye look at each individual photo as well as the whole.', '2007-05-01 13:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599832, 503396, 65319, '<td valign="top">The post processing on this one is brilliant! 10+ Fav</td>', 'The post processing on this one is brilliant! 10+ Fav', '2007-05-01 13:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599858, 503810, 77699, '<td valign="top">nice grain, has a rugged feel to it.</td>', 'nice grain, has a rugged feel to it.', '2007-05-01 13:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599864, 504595, 3102, '<td valign="top">My first thought was, "Why did someone enter a single picture into a Triptych challenge?"  Then I realized what you had done here.  Very interesting and unique!  I''m not sure it meets the textbook definition of triptych, but it is certainly an interesting series that I''m sure took a lot of effort.  I''m impressed!</td>', 'My first thought was, "Why did someone enter a single picture into a Triptych challenge?"  Then I realized what you had done here.  Very interesting and unique!  I''m not sure it meets the textbook definition of triptych, but it is certainly an interesting series that I''m sure took a lot of effort.  I''m impressed!', '2007-05-01 13:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599879, 504664, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice images, but aren''t really shown off to their full potential with the triptych style you''ve chosen.</td>', 'nice images, but aren''t really shown off to their full potential with the triptych style you''ve chosen.', '2007-05-01 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599892, 504614, 18219, '<td valign="top">mmmmm, apple pie!!!<br/>i''m not too keen on the second image as the steam sems to obscure most of the image.</td>', 'mmmmm, apple pie!!!i''m not too keen on the second image as the steam sems to obscure most of the image.', '2007-05-01 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599979, 504682, 56243, '<td valign="top">Did you take this picture through a fence?  At first I didn''t like it because of the way it''s cropped.  I would have cropped it horizontal instead of vertical, but then I noticed the shadows on on the white making it look like you captured it through a fence.  It''s a nice capture but maybe next time wait till someone is in all three sections.  The third portion doesn''t have anyone so it''s a little boring compared to the other two.</td>', 'Did you take this picture through a fence?  At first I didn''t like it because of the way it''s cropped.  I would have cropped it horizontal instead of vertical, but then I noticed the shadows on on the white making it look like you captured it through a fence.  It''s a nice capture but maybe next time wait till someone is in all three sections.  The third portion doesn''t have anyone so it''s a little boring compared to the other two.', '2007-05-01 14:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3599989, 503410, 56243, '<td valign="top">I just don''t understand what the tribute is to.  The content with the title confuses me a bit.</td>', 'I just don''t understand what the tribute is to.  The content with the title confuses me a bit.', '2007-05-01 14:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600021, 505082, 56243, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and serene.  I think I would have made it more of a panaramic triptych though.  Crop it just under that last big shadow and it automatically gains more character.  Just below if you want the water to be the focus and just above the last shadow if you want the land to be the focus.  Sorry it''s long, I''m trying to be constructive instead of leaving just "nice job".</td>', 'Very pretty and serene.  I think I would have made it more of a panaramic triptych though.  Crop it just under that last big shadow and it automatically gains more character.  Just below if you want the water to be the focus and just above the last shadow if you want the land to be the focus.  Sorry it''s long, I''m trying to be constructive instead of leaving just "nice job".', '2007-05-01 14:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600029, 504288, 3735, '<td valign="top">beautiful  10</td>', 'beautiful  10', '2007-05-01 14:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600037, 503138, 56243, '<td valign="top">It''s a really nice idea to try to capture life in a water tank but the rocks are the only items of focus.  Try to increase the shutter speed a bit to capture the fish swimming.  I don''t know what type of camera your using, but keep trying.  It''s a good idea!</td>', 'It''s a really nice idea to try to capture life in a water tank but the rocks are the only items of focus.  Try to increase the shutter speed a bit to capture the fish swimming.  I don''t know what type of camera your using, but keep trying.  It''s a good idea!', '2007-05-01 14:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600052, 505081, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - But feel the last pic lets down the other 2</td>', 'Great set - But feel the last pic lets down the other 2', '2007-05-01 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3600054, 505056, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Nice action</td>', 'Great set - Nice action', '2007-05-01 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
