(3600058, 504225, 56243, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice cathedral and I''m a superfan of vaulted celings.  They have so much character.  However maybe try having the middle be the full shot and the two on the sides be a closer look at specific items of the catherdral being the vaulted celings up close to see the texture or the glass windows or the organ all closer to, i guess romantisize it.  To show off it''s uniue characteristics.</td>', 'It''s a very nice cathedral and I''m a superfan of vaulted celings.  They have so much character.  However maybe try having the middle be the full shot and the two on the sides be a closer look at specific items of the catherdral being the vaulted celings up close to see the texture or the glass windows or the organ all closer to, i guess romantisize it.  To show off it''s uniue characteristics.', '2007-05-01 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
