(3600392, 504558, 72317, '<td valign="top">The images are very nice, but there isn''t a whole lot going on in a literal sense. Great use of black and white. It adds to the dilapidated look of the track. This looks like it''d be a difficult shot to get. Either you are a brave person and paid for a ride on an old rollercoaster, or you climbed onto it somehow. Either way, kudos to you for that.</td>', 'The images are very nice, but there isn''t a whole lot going on in a literal sense. Great use of black and white. It adds to the dilapidated look of the track. This looks like it''d be a difficult shot to get. Either you are a brave person and paid for a ride on an old rollercoaster, or you climbed onto it somehow. Either way, kudos to you for that.', '2007-05-01 15:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
