(3601413, 504863, 61961, '<td valign="top">On first round, I give this best in show!  The b&amp;w has depth and adds to the mood (it seems like so many times it is used in an attempt to make art out of a bad photo).  A strong 10 from me.  Good luck!<br/> <br/>Edit: Yup, best in show, with "he sleeps well" a close second.  I''m sure you''ll both do well.</td>', 'On first round, I give this best in show!  The b&w has depth and adds to the mood (it seems like so many times it is used in an attempt to make art out of a bad photo).  A strong 10 from me.  Good luck! Edit: Yup, best in show, with "he sleeps well" a close second.  I''m sure you''ll both do well.', '2007-05-01 17:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
