(3601578, 504872, 61961, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind that you have four photos in a triptych, but you get a "3" for laziness!  Why have more than one photo if they all are the same?  Four shots of the same car, from the same tourist-stance angle, taken at pretty much the same time (judging by the people in the background).  If the car is moving it doesn''t show, and if it is standing still than why not get a little creative: show a close-up of the number, or the driver, or the hubcup?  This doesn''t *reveal* anything.  Sorry if I sound harsh, but I know you can do better than this, whoever you are! :-)</td>', 'I don''t mind that you have four photos in a triptych, but you get a "3" for laziness!  Why have more than one photo if they all are the same?  Four shots of the same car, from the same tourist-stance angle, taken at pretty much the same time (judging by the people in the background).  If the car is moving it doesn''t show, and if it is standing still than why not get a little creative: show a close-up of the number, or the driver, or the hubcup?  This doesn''t *reveal* anything.  Sorry if I sound harsh, but I know you can do better than this, whoever you are! :-)', '2007-05-01 18:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
