(3601604, 504601, 61961, '<td valign="top">A fine subject for a triptych, and I like the black background, but none of the photos are in focus, which spoils your efforts.</td>', 'A fine subject for a triptych, and I like the black background, but none of the photos are in focus, which spoils your efforts.', '2007-05-01 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601620, 504251, 58590, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2007-05-01 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601624, 504117, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to hear the horse is grieving, but aside from the caption this doesn''t grab my attention.  I also think the blue frame is a terrible aesthetic choice, both for the color (it doesn''t go with the subject; an earth-tone would probably be better) and composition-wise.</td>', 'I''m sorry to hear the horse is grieving, but aside from the caption this doesn''t grab my attention.  I also think the blue frame is a terrible aesthetic choice, both for the color (it doesn''t go with the subject; an earth-tone would probably be better) and composition-wise.', '2007-05-01 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601639, 504353, 61961, '<td valign="top">Your idea is fine for a triptych, but the varying focal points are really odd.  I think the cartons don''t help your composition, either.</td>', 'Your idea is fine for a triptych, but the varying focal points are really odd.  I think the cartons don''t help your composition, either.', '2007-05-01 18:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601650, 504514, 61961, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of empty space in this triptych, and barely any variety in the three chosen photos.  The shadow at the bottom of each photo could probably have been cropped out, too, bringing the viewer closer to the splashes.</td>', 'There''s a lot of empty space in this triptych, and barely any variety in the three chosen photos.  The shadow at the bottom of each photo could probably have been cropped out, too, bringing the viewer closer to the splashes.', '2007-05-01 18:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601657, 503384, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the raindrops on the middle car, the lights in the third panel is just classic used car lot motif.  Nice.</td>', 'I like the raindrops on the middle car, the lights in the third panel is just classic used car lot motif.  Nice.', '2007-05-01 18:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601665, 504842, 61961, '<td valign="top">A beloved pet is a good subject for a personal triptych, but I think to appeal to the casual viewer these need to be better technically.  A full body shot, maybe running or in some other action, would have added variety.  The photo on the left isn''t very sharp, and in the top right photo the flash seems very harsh.</td>', 'A beloved pet is a good subject for a personal triptych, but I think to appeal to the casual viewer these need to be better technically.  A full body shot, maybe running or in some other action, would have added variety.  The photo on the left isn''t very sharp, and in the top right photo the flash seems very harsh.', '2007-05-01 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601671, 505102, 70514, '<td valign="top">I work at a women''s shelter here in KC, it''s nice to see attention brought to this "dirty little secret" that is way more prevalent than is said.   You did a nice job also of not making this look gratuitous (sorry, spelling is bad).</td>', 'I work at a women''s shelter here in KC, it''s nice to see attention brought to this "dirty little secret" that is way more prevalent than is said.   You did a nice job also of not making this look gratuitous (sorry, spelling is bad).', '2007-05-01 18:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601676, 504161, 18219, '<td valign="top">for me, this nearly works, but i think the blue background is a distraction rather than an enhancement</td>', 'for me, this nearly works, but i think the blue background is a distraction rather than an enhancement', '2007-05-01 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601682, 504529, 18219, '<td valign="top">would be better if the "container" wasn''t visible in the middle picture.<br/>great captures though.</td>', 'would be better if the "container" wasn''t visible in the middle picture.great captures though.', '2007-05-01 18:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601688, 503399, 18219, '<td valign="top">lovely colors and focus.<br/>for me, the worst part is the grey background in the middle image.<br/>something brighter would have better.<br/>that''s what i think anyway :-)</td>', 'lovely colors and focus.for me, the worst part is the grey background in the middle image.something brighter would have better.that''s what i think anyway :-)', '2007-05-01 18:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601695, 505101, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Great color on the rooster, that cow is funny (as they all are) and the ears on the pig... LOVE it all!  Nicely done.  What fun!</td>', 'Great idea!  Great color on the rooster, that cow is funny (as they all are) and the ears on the pig... LOVE it all!  Nicely done.  What fun!', '2007-05-01 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601720, 504891, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-05-01 18:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601723, 503434, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great job getting all that emotion in one "picture".  Great summary of a trip to the zoo!</td>', 'Great job getting all that emotion in one "picture".  Great summary of a trip to the zoo!', '2007-05-01 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601725, 504173, 70514, '<td valign="top">Funny story!</td>', 'Funny story!', '2007-05-01 18:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601734, 505111, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love how you took the same photograph and altered it three ways, different for this challenge.   Nice and refreshing.  Great incite!</td>', 'I love how you took the same photograph and altered it three ways, different for this challenge.   Nice and refreshing.  Great incite!', '2007-05-01 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601749, 504543, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great colors, interesting subject.  I assume this is from a performance of some kind, my only quibble is that it seems as if you are standing in the same spot for all photos -- which makes sense, but it might have been nice, for example, to catch the guy in the bottom left panel turning and facing the other direction.  Still, a high score from me!</td>', 'Great colors, interesting subject.  I assume this is from a performance of some kind, my only quibble is that it seems as if you are standing in the same spot for all photos -- which makes sense, but it might have been nice, for example, to catch the guy in the bottom left panel turning and facing the other direction.  Still, a high score from me!', '2007-05-01 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601767, 504161, 27839, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2007-05-01 18:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601769, 505093, 27839, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2007-05-01 18:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601976, 504322, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is a great juxtaposition and has nice texture detail.</td>', 'This is a great juxtaposition and has nice texture detail.', '2007-05-01 19:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3601996, 503384, 61651, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this, and how it conveys a sense of place.  Outstanding selective focus in the shots and particularly like the raindrops detail on the center image.  Can''t think of anything to improve, except perhaps the extra-thick border on top and bottom gives the overall image a heaviness it doesn''t need. One of my 10''s for this challenge.</td>', 'I love the feel of this, and how it conveys a sense of place.  Outstanding selective focus in the shots and particularly like the raindrops detail on the center image.  Can''t think of anything to improve, except perhaps the extra-thick border on top and bottom gives the overall image a heaviness it doesn''t need. One of my 10''s for this challenge.', '2007-05-01 19:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602023, 504150, 61651, '<td valign="top">What a great sequence, and very well done - nice non-distracting background and subject is super-sharp (not counting the motion blur in the 3rd panel, which is understandable).  I think the "story" is superior, but I guess others will also likely point out to you that the images don''t "match" - seems like the plant is either a different plant each time or shot from a different position.  This isn''t so much of a detraction for me, the story is what sells me on it, but maybe next time with a "progress" triptych like this, be more mindful about how well the subject matches position-wise and lighting-wise.  Boy, this is a long comment - sorry!  9</td>', 'What a great sequence, and very well done - nice non-distracting background and subject is super-sharp (not counting the motion blur in the 3rd panel, which is understandable).  I think the "story" is superior, but I guess others will also likely point out to you that the images don''t "match" - seems like the plant is either a different plant each time or shot from a different position.  This isn''t so much of a detraction for me, the story is what sells me on it, but maybe next time with a "progress" triptych like this, be more mindful about how well the subject matches position-wise and lighting-wise.  Boy, this is a long comment - sorry!  9', '2007-05-01 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602056, 504173, 61651, '<td valign="top">A clever and funny sequence, and well-shot.  I don''t know if you intended it or not, but placing the bench in the middle of the street gives it, for me, a "taken out of time" feel of a recollected memory, which is just perfect for the subject. 10</td>', 'A clever and funny sequence, and well-shot.  I don''t know if you intended it or not, but placing the bench in the middle of the street gives it, for me, a "taken out of time" feel of a recollected memory, which is just perfect for the subject. 10', '2007-05-01 19:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602130, 504594, 70181, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.  I''m not a huge fan of black and white, but I love it here.  Great contrast, and the eyes really stand out in each shot.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.  I''m not a huge fan of black and white, but I love it here.  Great contrast, and the eyes really stand out in each shot.', '2007-05-01 20:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602131, 504572, 70181, '<td valign="top">Beautiful captures.</td>', 'Beautiful captures.', '2007-05-01 20:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602134, 505071, 70181, '<td valign="top">Great shots, and I really like the presentation.</td>', 'Great shots, and I really like the presentation.', '2007-05-01 20:13:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3602200, 503624, 65035, '<td valign="top">I saw the thumbnail for this and thought oooooo strawberries and chocolate, I''m a bit disappointed there''s no chocolate but only because strawberries dipped in chocolate are amongst my favorite things. My initial disappointment has been more than made up for by the exquisite photography and beautiful composition.</td>', 'I saw the thumbnail for this and thought oooooo strawberries and chocolate, I''m a bit disappointed there''s no chocolate but only because strawberries dipped in chocolate are amongst my favorite things. My initial disappointment has been more than made up for by the exquisite photography and beautiful composition.', '2007-05-01 20:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602214, 505079, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wow this is wonderful, I hope you''re printing 3 copies.</td>', 'Wow this is wonderful, I hope you''re printing 3 copies.', '2007-05-01 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602236, 503646, 65035, '<td valign="top">Haha I didn''t have my screen fully open so I had to scroll down to see this this so it went..."Lion , nice... tiger, oooo I study on big cats, I like...Bear??" Then I realised the bear and I were wearing the same confused expression and I had to laugh. The title is perfect!</td>', 'Haha I didn''t have my screen fully open so I had to scroll down to see this this so it went..."Lion , nice... tiger, oooo I study on big cats, I like...Bear??" Then I realised the bear and I were wearing the same confused expression and I had to laugh. The title is perfect!', '2007-05-01 20:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602246, 504927, 74979, '<td valign="top">perfect for Mother''s Day!!</td>', 'perfect for Mother''s Day!!', '2007-05-01 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602275, 503786, 65035, '<td valign="top">This is so dreamy and gives such a wonderful feeling of warm leisure days and the joy of scraggly, lovingly picked bouquets.</td>', 'This is so dreamy and gives such a wonderful feeling of warm leisure days and the joy of scraggly, lovingly picked bouquets.', '2007-05-01 20:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602283, 503333, 34041, '<td valign="top">oops. Focus problems.  Also, the addition of the triptych baars don''t seem to compliment this image. Keep trying.</td>', 'oops. Focus problems.  Also, the addition of the triptych baars don''t seem to compliment this image. Keep trying.', '2007-05-01 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602295, 504863, 65035, '<td valign="top">This is a bit different from the usual surf shots, I love the silhouettes and the sparkle of the surf. Very dramatic and works beautifully as a triptych.</td>', 'This is a bit different from the usual surf shots, I love the silhouettes and the sparkle of the surf. Very dramatic and works beautifully as a triptych.', '2007-05-01 20:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602316, 504117, 34041, '<td valign="top">Not sure the blue bars add anything to this photo.</td>', 'Not sure the blue bars add anything to this photo.', '2007-05-01 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602351, 504807, 74979, '<td valign="top">poor poor pidge!</td>', 'poor poor pidge!', '2007-05-01 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602356, 504244, 74979, '<td valign="top">oh!  che bella''Roma!! Mi piacono tanto!</td>', 'oh!  che bella''Roma!! Mi piacono tanto!', '2007-05-01 20:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602389, 505102, 34041, '<td valign="top">don''t like this one.</td>', 'don''t like this one.', '2007-05-01 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602397, 504150, 57378, '<td valign="top">Love this one - Simple but effective in every way. 10</td>', 'Love this one - Simple but effective in every way. 10', '2007-05-01 21:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602448, 505102, 65035, '<td valign="top">Very powerful and very well done. At first I wasn''t comfortable with her expression it just seemed too peaceful for such violence but the more I look at it the more I get the feeling of peace at last. The blood on the soap and the dirty sink is just perfect, I would have liked to see a scratch or bruise or something on him to say that she fought back...but then many don''t. I applaud your courage at tackling such a difficult issue and doing it so well.</td>', 'Very powerful and very well done. At first I wasn''t comfortable with her expression it just seemed too peaceful for such violence but the more I look at it the more I get the feeling of peace at last. The blood on the soap and the dirty sink is just perfect, I would have liked to see a scratch or bruise or something on him to say that she fought back...but then many don''t. I applaud your courage at tackling such a difficult issue and doing it so well.', '2007-05-01 21:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602454, 504222, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Like the lighting - The violinist would be a great stand alone shot. Really beautiful</td>', 'Great set - Like the lighting - The violinist would be a great stand alone shot. Really beautiful', '2007-05-01 21:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602459, 503583, 57378, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is a little dull I am afraid.</td>', 'The subject matter is a little dull I am afraid.', '2007-05-01 21:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602464, 501937, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice colours</td>', 'Nice colours', '2007-05-01 21:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602469, 503328, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Like those shadow boxes. Wish the gull on the right pic was a little more right himself to balance this nice set out.</td>', 'Great set - Like those shadow boxes. Wish the gull on the right pic was a little more right himself to balance this nice set out.', '2007-05-01 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602472, 504891, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Like the odd sizing - Works well here - Nice tones too. Pleasing image. 9</td>', 'Great set - Like the odd sizing - Works well here - Nice tones too. Pleasing image. 9', '2007-05-01 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602476, 505076, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Sweet set - Just wish you had gotten those tails in as there is an unbalanced feel with the room above their heads. Nice and sharp though.</td>', 'Great set - Sweet set - Just wish you had gotten those tails in as there is an unbalanced feel with the room above their heads. Nice and sharp though.', '2007-05-01 21:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602485, 504604, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Really works well and is very creative. Nice one.</td>', 'Great set - Really works well and is very creative. Nice one.', '2007-05-01 21:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602487, 504543, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Like the lighting.</td>', 'Great set - Like the lighting.', '2007-05-01 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602490, 505091, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice depth but the image on the right lets the set down. The angles seem to all be going in odd directions.</td>', 'Nice depth but the image on the right lets the set down. The angles seem to all be going in odd directions.', '2007-05-01 21:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602493, 504748, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - But the colours seem a little washed out.</td>', 'Great set - But the colours seem a little washed out.', '2007-05-01 21:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602497, 503496, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Good light.</td>', 'Great set - Good light.', '2007-05-01 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602505, 505110, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - But feel the highlighted pic on the left should have been in the middle which would have been balanced out by the two darker balls. Regardless of techs in this challenge all 3 have to be viewed as one and show balance. Nice sharpness.</td>', 'Great set - But feel the highlighted pic on the left should have been in the middle which would have been balanced out by the two darker balls. Regardless of techs in this challenge all 3 have to be viewed as one and show balance. Nice sharpness.', '2007-05-01 21:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602509, 504780, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Good light. Maybe closer on the first 2 pics would have focused us more on the flower.</td>', 'Great set - Good light. Maybe closer on the first 2 pics would have focused us more on the flower.', '2007-05-01 21:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602521, 504783, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Like the way the right two are connected - Works well.</td>', 'Great set - Like the way the right two are connected - Works well.', '2007-05-01 21:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602526, 504178, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Great lighting and focus. All the images work really well together which is important in this challenge. Could have come straight out of a text book. Very nice 9 - If I had one gripe it would be the highlight at the top of the first pic on the left.</td>', 'Great set - Great lighting and focus. All the images work really well together which is important in this challenge. Could have come straight out of a text book. Very nice 9 - If I had one gripe it would be the highlight at the top of the first pic on the left.', '2007-05-01 21:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602531, 504262, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - The big pic is a little boring in the angle it was taken - This only shows out more because of the great POV you have used in the other 2 pics. Lastly it is a shame that you lose the box effect on the top left picture because the highlight bleeds into the border. Still nice to look at though.</td>', 'Great set - The big pic is a little boring in the angle it was taken - This only shows out more because of the great POV you have used in the other 2 pics. Lastly it is a shame that you lose the box effect on the top left picture because the highlight bleeds into the border. Still nice to look at though.', '2007-05-01 21:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602535, 504311, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Maybe just a tad heavy against the highlight areas.</td>', 'Great set - Maybe just a tad heavy against the highlight areas.', '2007-05-01 21:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602537, 502872, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Nice lighting. Maybe more of a variety would have added some interest. Good figure work though.</td>', 'Great set - Nice lighting. Maybe more of a variety would have added some interest. Good figure work though.', '2007-05-01 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602539, 504725, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice pics but seem to be lacking in some much needed contrast.</td>', 'Nice pics but seem to be lacking in some much needed contrast.', '2007-05-01 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602542, 505097, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice pic that have more of a personal interest than anything else. Maybe more variety and similar lighting on the face would have helped?</td>', 'Nice pic that have more of a personal interest than anything else. Maybe more variety and similar lighting on the face would have helped?', '2007-05-01 21:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602549, 504838, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Love the lighting and soft PP feel. For me though maybe a switch of pics 1 and 3 would have helped this. I feel the woman is looking out of the frame in 3 and again in 1 a switch would have really put this all together as the single pics are just as important as looking at all 3 together. Nice though.</td>', 'Great set - Love the lighting and soft PP feel. For me though maybe a switch of pics 1 and 3 would have helped this. I feel the woman is looking out of the frame in 3 and again in 1 a switch would have really put this all together as the single pics are just as important as looking at all 3 together. Nice though.', '2007-05-01 21:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602551, 504906, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Nice idea - For some reason the rust colour distracts me a little? Also pic 3 the woman maybe should have turned and faced the other way to keep us in the frame of the whole series.</td>', 'Great set - Nice idea - For some reason the rust colour distracts me a little? Also pic 3 the woman maybe should have turned and faced the other way to keep us in the frame of the whole series.', '2007-05-01 21:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602556, 504549, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the story here quite a bit.  The background works very well, too.  Halo effect around her head is kind of patchy and unrealistic on my monitor, particularly on the portrait.</td>', 'Like the story here quite a bit.  The background works very well, too.  Halo effect around her head is kind of patchy and unrealistic on my monitor, particularly on the portrait.', '2007-05-01 21:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602557, 503620, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Pic 2 with the flies really stands out as the best image - If the others were in a similar vein this would have been great.</td>', 'Great set - Pic 2 with the flies really stands out as the best image - If the others were in a similar vein this would have been great.', '2007-05-01 21:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602562, 502066, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but a little too busy to look at - More use of a shallow depth of field would have helped.</td>', 'Nice colours but a little too busy to look at - More use of a shallow depth of field would have helped.', '2007-05-01 21:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602568, 503018, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Love the colours - Could see this hanging in a funky LA home. Nice.One thing though - Maybe the right hand picture could have had the cactus on the right which would have kept this whole series really tight and kept us i the frame.</td>', 'Great set - Love the colours - Could see this hanging in a funky LA home. Nice.One thing though - Maybe the right hand picture could have had the cactus on the right which would have kept this whole series really tight and kept us i the frame.', '2007-05-01 21:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602571, 504192, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - Shame the lighting in the middle pic is uneven as it makes the whole set seem off kilt.</td>', 'Nice idea - Shame the lighting in the middle pic is uneven as it makes the whole set seem off kilt.', '2007-05-01 21:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602576, 504751, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Funky - Contemporary and wouldn''t look out of place on the wall of a contemporary home in LA - i love it. Well executed. 10</td>', 'Great set - Funky - Contemporary and wouldn''t look out of place on the wall of a contemporary home in LA - i love it. Well executed. 10', '2007-05-01 21:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602580, 504498, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Wow in your face! - Maybe a bit too much?</td>', 'Great set - Wow in your face! - Maybe a bit too much?', '2007-05-01 21:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602584, 504828, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice light be the subject is a little low in the frame which leaves a lot of unused areas - Which in a lot of cases is a good thing but not here I am afraid.</td>', 'Nice light be the subject is a little low in the frame which leaves a lot of unused areas - Which in a lot of cases is a good thing but not here I am afraid.', '2007-05-01 21:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602593, 503690, 57378, '<td valign="top">Like the grey but the images look  a little too stark and over flashed plus the fern has been rotated and looks odd.</td>', 'Like the grey but the images look  a little too stark and over flashed plus the fern has been rotated and looks odd.', '2007-05-01 21:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602597, 503619, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Love the use of contrast in the boxes - Very clever.</td>', 'Great set - Love the use of contrast in the boxes - Very clever.', '2007-05-01 21:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602602, 504468, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - The lighting really adds to the box edges where light meets dark. Nice.</td>', 'Great set - The lighting really adds to the box edges where light meets dark. Nice.', '2007-05-01 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602603, 504847, 65234, '<td valign="top">You skipped the part where the female eats the male ;-)</td>', 'You skipped the part where the female eats the male ;-)', '2007-05-01 21:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602607, 502569, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice images but they are a little small to appreciate - Closer attention to individual bells may have worked a bit better as there is too much going on.</td>', 'Nice images but they are a little small to appreciate - Closer attention to individual bells may have worked a bit better as there is too much going on.', '2007-05-01 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602613, 505000, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great set - Nice and bright!</td>', 'Great set - Nice and bright!', '2007-05-01 21:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602622, 504326, 43191, '<td valign="top">What are these?? Orange bags? Unusual.</td>', 'What are these?? Orange bags? Unusual.', '2007-05-01 21:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602625, 505081, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stunning scenery.  Would like a bit more seperation between panels to better appreciate each individually, particularly as the colors and exposure vary somewhat.</td>', 'Stunning scenery.  Would like a bit more seperation between panels to better appreciate each individually, particularly as the colors and exposure vary somewhat.', '2007-05-01 21:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
