(3604390, 504958, 74533, '<td valign="top">Wish the two smaller photos had the vibrance of colour that the large one does. Love the composition of each photo and of the triptych.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'Wish the two smaller photos had the vibrance of colour that the large one does. Love the composition of each photo and of the triptych.  One of my favourites.', '2007-05-02 06:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
