(3604417, 504150, 74533, '<td valign="top">Pity the lady bug wasn''t focused in the last shot.  Lovely colours.  It would have been good if you could have had the plant in the last shot with the same colour and texture as in the first two.</td>', 'Pity the lady bug wasn''t focused in the last shot.  Lovely colours.  It would have been good if you could have had the plant in the last shot with the same colour and texture as in the first two.', '2007-05-02 06:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
