(3604652, 504530, 18219, '<td valign="top">i think the actual images are good.<br/>but i''m not too keen on the borders that you''ve used.<br/>they don''t seem to fit in with the overall feel of the triptych.</td>', 'i think the actual images are good.but i''m not too keen on the borders that you''ve used.they don''t seem to fit in with the overall feel of the triptych.', '2007-05-02 08:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
