(3604667, 503496, 18219, '<td valign="top">the faces on the statues are brilliant.<br/>but that''s not because of your photograph!<br/>maybe if you had a different angle on each panel it would have made it more "your shot".<br/>still, it''s an interesting piece.<br/>good luck.</td>', 'the faces on the statues are brilliant.but that''s not because of your photograph!maybe if you had a different angle on each panel it would have made it more "your shot".still, it''s an interesting piece.good luck.', '2007-05-02 08:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
