(3604900, 504148, 44741, '<td valign="top">Too much editing effects.</td>', 'Too much editing effects.', '2007-05-02 09:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604904, 504725, 70270, '<td valign="top">These are all nice pictures, but all three are detail shots and you might have swapped one of them out for an overall picture of the ship to give context to the story. I would have swapped out the shot on the upper left, which should have been a lot tighter on the main subject imo.</td>', 'These are all nice pictures, but all three are detail shots and you might have swapped one of them out for an overall picture of the ship to give context to the story. I would have swapped out the shot on the upper left, which should have been a lot tighter on the main subject imo.', '2007-05-02 09:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604921, 503813, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  The middle and right shots are too similar, though ... early morning, noon and twilight would have worked better, particularly on a less cloudy day.</td>', 'Nice idea!  The middle and right shots are too similar, though ... early morning, noon and twilight would have worked better, particularly on a less cloudy day.', '2007-05-02 09:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604934, 505111, 44741, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.</td>', 'Nice setup.', '2007-05-02 09:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604937, 503386, 70270, '<td valign="top">The picture on the right is great.  The middle picture is a nice detail shot, but could have been smaller and cropped at the top and bottom.  The one on the left doesn''t do a lot for me.  Perhaps a different layout and swapping out the left pic would have improved this.</td>', 'The picture on the right is great.  The middle picture is a nice detail shot, but could have been smaller and cropped at the top and bottom.  The one on the left doesn''t do a lot for me.  Perhaps a different layout and swapping out the left pic would have improved this.', '2007-05-02 10:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604942, 504823, 44741, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous</td>', 'Gorgeous', '2007-05-02 10:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604946, 505049, 70270, '<td valign="top">funny.  I wish the bird on the right was out of the water so you could see its full body.  maybe using 3 different pics to get the same idea would have been better, but I like how you used one to keep the water flowing throughout all three images.</td>', 'funny.  I wish the bird on the right was out of the water so you could see its full body.  maybe using 3 different pics to get the same idea would have been better, but I like how you used one to keep the water flowing throughout all three images.', '2007-05-02 10:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604950, 504265, 70270, '<td valign="top">Three nice pictures, but all kind of similar.  Internal borders would help separate the three as well.</td>', 'Three nice pictures, but all kind of similar.  Internal borders would help separate the three as well.', '2007-05-02 10:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604961, 503333, 44741, '<td valign="top">I think this would look very cool in focus. As it is...</td>', 'I think this would look very cool in focus. As it is...', '2007-05-02 10:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3604965, 503690, 70270, '<td valign="top">very nice layout and use of negative space -- leads the eye right to the main subject. The picture on the top left is weak, though, and drags down the overall image a bit.</td>', 'very nice layout and use of negative space -- leads the eye right to the main subject. The picture on the top left is weak, though, and drags down the overall image a bit.', '2007-05-02 10:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
