(3605713, 504904, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think I''d rather see either a thematic connection in all three pics or variety in all three.  Like maybe a side view of his head (I know, I know - you can''t get up there to look straight across).  Alternatively, three different shots of different aspects - for example, him, one of his speeches, and the corner shot.  This looks like "two shots of Lincoln and one shot of something else because I couldn''t think of a third shot of Lincoln."  That said, all three are good shots and visually interesting.  It''s only as triptych that I''d like it better using the suggestions above.  That said, I''m still voting it a 6.</td>', 'I think I''d rather see either a thematic connection in all three pics or variety in all three.  Like maybe a side view of his head (I know, I know - you can''t get up there to look straight across).  Alternatively, three different shots of different aspects - for example, him, one of his speeches, and the corner shot.  This looks like "two shots of Lincoln and one shot of something else because I couldn''t think of a third shot of Lincoln."  That said, all three are good shots and visually interesting.  It''s only as triptych that I''d like it better using the suggestions above.  That said, I''m still voting it a 6.', '2007-05-02 12:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
