(3605728, 503410, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is just a jumble.  Try to think of something specific you want to show the viewer in each shot.<br/> <br/>Also, play around with editing software to learn how to enhance contrast.  Curves, levels, and other adjustments are available.  Each of these shots is very washed out.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is just a jumble.  Try to think of something specific you want to show the viewer in each shot. Also, play around with editing software to learn how to enhance contrast.  Curves, levels, and other adjustments are available.  Each of these shots is very washed out.', '2007-05-02 12:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
