(3605732, 504554, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - Just find the different white balances makes the picture not gel well together.</td>', 'Nice idea - Just find the different white balances makes the picture not gel well together.', '2007-05-02 12:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605733, 503386, 60862, '<td valign="top">Terrific concept and execution!  Love the colors, love the variety of subjects.  And you put them together nicely, too.</td>', 'Terrific concept and execution!  Love the colors, love the variety of subjects.  And you put them together nicely, too.', '2007-05-02 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605735, 503813, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well captured.</td>', 'Nice idea and well captured.', '2007-05-02 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605738, 503766, 57378, '<td valign="top">Someone has some good photoshop skills!! Nice idea - Maybe has more of a personal appeal than a public one.</td>', 'Someone has some good photoshop skills!! Nice idea - Maybe has more of a personal appeal than a public one.', '2007-05-02 12:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605741, 504559, 60862, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors!  I also like the variety in your subjects.</td>', 'beautiful colors!  I also like the variety in your subjects.', '2007-05-02 12:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605743, 505071, 57378, '<td valign="top">Lovely captures and i can''t help thinking this would be much better in black and white. Maybe has more of a personal appeal than public. Still very nice though.</td>', 'Lovely captures and i can''t help thinking this would be much better in black and white. Maybe has more of a personal appeal than public. Still very nice though.', '2007-05-02 12:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605748, 504863, 60862, '<td valign="top">Three great shots, with interesting contrasts and textures, artfully put together.  Well done!</td>', 'Three great shots, with interesting contrasts and textures, artfully put together.  Well done!', '2007-05-02 12:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605749, 504753, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great curves and colors!</td>', 'Great curves and colors!', '2007-05-02 12:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605751, 504760, 57378, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feel to this - Lots of emotion here which a lot of kiddy photo''s on this site do not capture. Well done. If anything next time a nice plain t-shirt would really help pics like these.</td>', 'Wonderful feel to this - Lots of emotion here which a lot of kiddy photo''s on this site do not capture. Well done. If anything next time a nice plain t-shirt would really help pics like these.', '2007-05-02 12:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605756, 504969, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice captures and layout.</td>', 'Nice captures and layout.', '2007-05-02 12:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605759, 502785, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp images - Maybe a variety of pics would have helped add some interest.</td>', 'Nice sharp images - Maybe a variety of pics would have helped add some interest.', '2007-05-02 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605760, 503635, 18219, '<td valign="top">if only his face was sharper then this would be really really good instead of really good.</td>', 'if only his face was sharper then this would be really really good instead of really good.', '2007-05-02 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605794, 504288, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m really torn on this one.  The bottom image is postcard-perfect, the upper right image is nicely composed, and the borders and background set off the individual images well.  I just don''t care for the image on the upper left, which is where my eye goes first.  It''s not bad; it''s just not as spectacular as the others.  Think I might have preferred something a little different there, like the very top of the tower with the red light and the cables.</td>', 'I''m really torn on this one.  The bottom image is postcard-perfect, the upper right image is nicely composed, and the borders and background set off the individual images well.  I just don''t care for the image on the upper left, which is where my eye goes first.  It''s not bad; it''s just not as spectacular as the others.  Think I might have preferred something a little different there, like the very top of the tower with the red light and the cables.', '2007-05-02 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605800, 504637, 65234, '<td valign="top">Creative division of panels!  I find the different shirt in the left panel distracts from the poses/faces.</td>', 'Creative division of panels!  I find the different shirt in the left panel distracts from the poses/faces.', '2007-05-02 13:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605802, 505025, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw; very cute.  Definitely tells a story, and a very old one ;-)</td>', 'Aw; very cute.  Definitely tells a story, and a very old one ;-)', '2007-05-02 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605810, 504474, 65234, '<td valign="top">Had to Google the term; this now qualifies as my "something new learned" for today!  Impressive athleticism shown here.</td>', 'Had to Google the term; this now qualifies as my "something new learned" for today!  Impressive athleticism shown here.', '2007-05-02 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605811, 504713, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit bright but I doubt you had much control over that.  Panels go together well in telling the story without distraction.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit bright but I doubt you had much control over that.  Panels go together well in telling the story without distraction.', '2007-05-02 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605831, 504117, 18219, '<td valign="top">well, that certainly is some unusual editing there!<br/>it''s almost like an optical illusion.<br/>"which is the longer piece, A, B or C?"<br/>:-)<br/> <br/>but seriously, nice photo, but i''m not too keen on the way you''ve divided it.<br/>the blue does nothing for the image in my opinion.</td>', 'well, that certainly is some unusual editing there!it''s almost like an optical illusion."which is the longer piece, A, B or C?":-) but seriously, nice photo, but i''m not too keen on the way you''ve divided it.the blue does nothing for the image in my opinion.', '2007-05-02 13:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605845, 505056, 73414, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2007-05-02 13:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605851, 504906, 73414, '<td valign="top">I like the idea..but not so much the way she''s posed. I like the 1st panel--what''s up with her stance? 6</td>', 'I like the idea..but not so much the way she''s posed. I like the 1st panel--what''s up with her stance? 6', '2007-05-02 13:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3605857, 503766, 73414, '<td valign="top">How stinkin cool. 10 from me!</td>', 'How stinkin cool. 10 from me!', '2007-05-02 13:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
