(3606140, 504288, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job.</td>', 'Great job.', '2007-05-02 14:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606155, 503333, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is nice but it''s just too out-of-focus for me. Just my opinion.</td>', 'This is nice but it''s just too out-of-focus for me. Just my opinion.', '2007-05-02 14:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606160, 504708, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds. Very nice peaceful shot.</td>', 'I love the clouds. Very nice peaceful shot.', '2007-05-02 14:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606268, 504891, 63700, '<td valign="top">This has to be the same barn from Ominous Sky!  Both Great Pics!  I''ll be anxious to see where this finishes.  Good Luck!</td>', 'This has to be the same barn from Ominous Sky!  Both Great Pics!  I''ll be anxious to see where this finishes.  Good Luck!', '2007-05-02 15:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606297, 503624, 74765, '<td valign="top">Is the picture over sharpened? The strawberry looks unreal.</td>', 'Is the picture over sharpened? The strawberry looks unreal.', '2007-05-02 15:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606303, 504100, 74765, '<td valign="top">Nice, it tells a story.</td>', 'Nice, it tells a story.', '2007-05-02 15:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606354, 504244, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice triptych and photography but I think the background color is a little over powering.</td>', 'Nice triptych and photography but I think the background color is a little over powering.', '2007-05-02 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606372, 504327, 22970, '<td valign="top">A little soft in detail but feel it works with the pastel colors your have chosen. Even though I would of liked to see just a bit more sharpness on the center of the flowers. A good example that every picture does not have to be sharp, sharp, and sharper to be good. I like the use of tones.</td>', 'A little soft in detail but feel it works with the pastel colors your have chosen. Even though I would of liked to see just a bit more sharpness on the center of the flowers. A good example that every picture does not have to be sharp, sharp, and sharper to be good. I like the use of tones.', '2007-05-02 15:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606377, 503583, 74765, '<td valign="top">You have a story, one of the panes could have shown a closeup of the guy on the lawn mover.</td>', 'You have a story, one of the panes could have shown a closeup of the guy on the lawn mover.', '2007-05-02 16:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606386, 504601, 74765, '<td valign="top">The flowers looks blured.</td>', 'The flowers looks blured.', '2007-05-02 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606437, 504161, 56243, '<td valign="top">I Love This One!!  It may just be my favorite so far.  I love how you lined it up perfectly, and how each is the same, yet different!  Sorry if it doesn''t make sence.  I''m up way earlier than usual :)</td>', 'I Love This One!!  It may just be my favorite so far.  I love how you lined it up perfectly, and how each is the same, yet different!  Sorry if it doesn''t make sence.  I''m up way earlier than usual :)', '2007-05-02 16:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606440, 504780, 56243, '<td valign="top">beautiful flower.  And I love the way you framed it!</td>', 'beautiful flower.  And I love the way you framed it!', '2007-05-02 16:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606458, 504117, 74765, '<td valign="top">The shot of the horse is good, but I dont like the thick frame across the picture.</td>', 'The shot of the horse is good, but I dont like the thick frame across the picture.', '2007-05-02 16:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606485, 504958, 74765, '<td valign="top">You have cought the positive feeling and there is a story. I would liked to see one close up of the couple.</td>', 'You have cought the positive feeling and there is a story. I would liked to see one close up of the couple.', '2007-05-02 16:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606536, 504173, 56243, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2007-05-02 16:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606707, 504171, 76441, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I''m a little confused about the composition--it seems a little forced</td>', 'Nice colors, but I''m a little confused about the composition--it seems a little forced', '2007-05-02 17:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606714, 504906, 76441, '<td valign="top">Very classy, good idea</td>', 'Very classy, good idea', '2007-05-02 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606719, 504173, 76441, '<td valign="top">Nice story telling--fun!</td>', 'Nice story telling--fun!', '2007-05-02 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606724, 503712, 76441, '<td valign="top">Great detail, good idea, good consistent composition</td>', 'Great detail, good idea, good consistent composition', '2007-05-02 17:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606954, 504260, 73414, '<td valign="top">Swan Princess! 7</td>', 'Swan Princess! 7', '2007-05-02 18:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607062, 504322, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice, kind of artsy.  I can see it on a wall in a den with leather furniture.  And I appreciate that the skin appears to still be attached to each of the animals!</td>', 'Nice, kind of artsy.  I can see it on a wall in a den with leather furniture.  And I appreciate that the skin appears to still be attached to each of the animals!', '2007-05-02 18:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607065, 504192, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative to use the mirrors for your views.</td>', 'Interesting and creative to use the mirrors for your views.', '2007-05-02 18:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607079, 503971, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am not usually a fan of the fake divisions but this works very well.  OK, I am assuming one picture with drawn borders and selected desat and maybe you actually put together several photos, which would be even more impressive.  Regardless, I like the effect very much.</td>', 'I am not usually a fan of the fake divisions but this works very well.  OK, I am assuming one picture with drawn borders and selected desat and maybe you actually put together several photos, which would be even more impressive.  Regardless, I like the effect very much.', '2007-05-02 18:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607088, 505034, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely; everything works perfectly together to focus my attention on what is different in each panel, which is the stage of the flower.  Well done.</td>', 'Lovely; everything works perfectly together to focus my attention on what is different in each panel, which is the stage of the flower.  Well done.', '2007-05-02 18:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607100, 504262, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice selection of panels; each could stand on its own and they work well together.</td>', 'Very nice selection of panels; each could stand on its own and they work well together.', '2007-05-02 18:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607109, 502785, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice progression of the action.  Were you shooting behind a fence or some plants?  I see light-colored shadow objects, on the middle and bottom panels particularly.</td>', 'Nice progression of the action.  Were you shooting behind a fence or some plants?  I see light-colored shadow objects, on the middle and bottom panels particularly.', '2007-05-02 18:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607113, 503914, 65234, '<td valign="top">This looks like a lovely, serene place.</td>', 'This looks like a lovely, serene place.', '2007-05-02 18:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607115, 504161, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge and nice use of expert editing.</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge and nice use of expert editing.', '2007-05-02 18:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607116, 505000, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and layout.  The arrangement on the right is blatantly not in color order, though, which is bugging me!!</td>', 'Like the colors and layout.  The arrangement on the right is blatantly not in color order, though, which is bugging me!!', '2007-05-02 18:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607117, 505076, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice storytelling here!</td>', 'Nice storytelling here!', '2007-05-02 18:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607118, 503786, 65234, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge and lovely image.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge and lovely image.', '2007-05-02 18:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607120, 504529, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is that a worm?  Someone is actually handfeeding a worm to a bird?!  Quite unusual capture.  I LOVE the last pic; that pose is unique and beautiful.  Would have preferrred not to have the white container or lid showing in any of the panels, but once the bird came to feed I''m sure adjustments weren''t an option.  Great story overall.</td>', 'Is that a worm?  Someone is actually handfeeding a worm to a bird?!  Quite unusual capture.  I LOVE the last pic; that pose is unique and beautiful.  Would have preferrred not to have the white container or lid showing in any of the panels, but once the bird came to feed I''m sure adjustments weren''t an option.  Great story overall.', '2007-05-02 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607122, 504548, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice action shots.</td>', 'Nice action shots.', '2007-05-02 18:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607127, 504614, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the yellow liquid is; my applie pie doesn''t have sequences like this.  Nicely done, even if it does look more like curry at the end (to me).</td>', 'Not sure what the yellow liquid is; my applie pie doesn''t have sequences like this.  Nicely done, even if it does look more like curry at the end (to me).', '2007-05-02 18:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607139, 504109, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dandelions are a popular subject in this challenge!  Story is simply and well presented here.</td>', 'Dandelions are a popular subject in this challenge!  Story is simply and well presented here.', '2007-05-02 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607168, 504262, 3032, '<td valign="top">O yes, very cool!<br/>Tuesday evening all flowers were taken off, just like he said. Passed it when I rode in the background there with my motorcycle. At the moment there are two fields remaining (except the experimental field), both cannot be accessed easily and both will probably be gone by the end of the week. You came just in time. :)<br/>I really like it, should win a ribbon.</td>', 'O yes, very cool!Tuesday evening all flowers were taken off, just like he said. Passed it when I rode in the background there with my motorcycle. At the moment there are two fields remaining (except the experimental field), both cannot be accessed easily and both will probably be gone by the end of the week. You came just in time. :)I really like it, should win a ribbon.', '2007-05-02 18:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607213, 504957, 77192, '<td valign="top">Was this photo taken near Auckland? Just a mad hunch.</td>', 'Was this photo taken near Auckland? Just a mad hunch.', '2007-05-02 18:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607215, 504637, 77192, '<td valign="top">Hehehe very clever. Turned the concept on its head nicely there</td>', 'Hehehe very clever. Turned the concept on its head nicely there', '2007-05-02 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607732, 505111, 2158, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done here, but I think a thin white border around each shot would have helped.  The left and centre images seem to mere into each other near the top.</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done here, but I think a thin white border around each shot would have helped.  The left and centre images seem to mere into each other near the top.', '2007-05-02 20:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607830, 503399, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the centre and right-hand images.  Not too crazy about the one on the left though.</td>', 'I love the centre and right-hand images.  Not too crazy about the one on the left though.', '2007-05-02 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607837, 504117, 72317, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse.<br/>Anywho, the image looks a bit noisy or out of focus. I can''t really tell which. It does give a certain feel, though.<br/>The bright blue is an interesting choice. It doesn''t seem to fit the images very well, though.<br/>Also, I''m just curious, is that bump on the horses hindquarters really there, or was it created when putting the pictures together?</td>', 'Beautiful horse.Anywho, the image looks a bit noisy or out of focus. I can''t really tell which. It does give a certain feel, though.The bright blue is an interesting choice. It doesn''t seem to fit the images very well, though.Also, I''m just curious, is that bump on the horses hindquarters really there, or was it created when putting the pictures together?', '2007-05-02 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608005, 504927, 65858, '<td valign="top">Lovely collection.  I might have liked the borders aligned, and whatever she''s holding is a bit distracting, but very nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely collection.  I might have liked the borders aligned, and whatever she''s holding is a bit distracting, but very nicely done.', '2007-05-02 22:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608012, 501958, 65858, '<td valign="top">I really like the human element here - very fun.</td>', 'I really like the human element here - very fun.', '2007-05-02 22:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608019, 504150, 65858, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  An excellent storyline - I love the third pane DOF.  8!<br/> <br/>P.S. I think what would really make this one pop is some careful editing to make the upper half of the plant look sharper and remove a touch of the blue cast.</td>', 'Very cool!  An excellent storyline - I love the third pane DOF.  8! P.S. I think what would really make this one pop is some careful editing to make the upper half of the plant look sharper and remove a touch of the blue cast.', '2007-05-02 22:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608022, 503635, 65858, '<td valign="top">Excellent story - I love it!  8!<br/> <br/>P.S. The portrait could have been just a touch sharper.</td>', 'Excellent story - I love it!  8! P.S. The portrait could have been just a touch sharper.', '2007-05-02 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608033, 505001, 65858, '<td valign="top">Captivating shot.  To me, it seems to mocks the often phony nature of politics.</td>', 'Captivating shot.  To me, it seems to mocks the often phony nature of politics.', '2007-05-02 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608046, 505102, 73505, '<td valign="top">wow a bit disturbing!</td>', 'wow a bit disturbing!', '2007-05-02 22:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608094, 504291, 65858, '<td valign="top">=)  Very creative.</td>', '=)  Very creative.', '2007-05-02 22:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608406, 505111, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting! Makes you wonder what that tree looks like at different times of the day.</td>', 'Interesting! Makes you wonder what that tree looks like at different times of the day.', '2007-05-02 23:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608421, 505081, 7485, '<td valign="top">The top one is spectacular and the three work well together</td>', 'The top one is spectacular and the three work well together', '2007-05-02 23:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3608445, 503513, 7485, '<td valign="top">The two smaller ones are both excellent, but I think they might work better against a less busy background image</td>', 'The two smaller ones are both excellent, but I think they might work better against a less busy background image', '2007-05-02 23:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
