(3609877, 504173, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great use of a triptych to tell a story.  8</td>', 'Great use of a triptych to tell a story.  8', '2007-05-03 10:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609884, 504192, 70270, '<td valign="top">A well seen scene, nicely captured. You used the mirrors to good effect, and managed to keep yourself out of the image while still not appearing to shoot at an angle to the glass.  9</td>', 'A well seen scene, nicely captured. You used the mirrors to good effect, and managed to keep yourself out of the image while still not appearing to shoot at an angle to the glass.  9', '2007-05-03 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609902, 505063, 70270, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pictures and wonderful exposure.  I like the crop, but not sure I like the use of the same image on the right and left, though I do like how you defied convention and had the curves going out of the frame ... my first reaction on seeing this was that the R &amp; L sides should have been flipped to create an arch leading into the scene, but after looking at it some more i think you made the right choice.  8</td>', 'Beautiful pictures and wonderful exposure.  I like the crop, but not sure I like the use of the same image on the right and left, though I do like how you defied convention and had the curves going out of the frame ... my first reaction on seeing this was that the R & L sides should have been flipped to create an arch leading into the scene, but after looking at it some more i think you made the right choice.  8', '2007-05-03 10:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609908, 504549, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the documentary feel to this and the way you arranged the images, but personally I don''t care much for the processing, it seems "too much" for me.  This could also work well as black and white, I think.  You picked a subject most people wouldn''t and composed it thoughtfully, apart from the processing issue - 9.</td>', 'I like the documentary feel to this and the way you arranged the images, but personally I don''t care much for the processing, it seems "too much" for me.  This could also work well as black and white, I think.  You picked a subject most people wouldn''t and composed it thoughtfully, apart from the processing issue - 9.', '2007-05-03 10:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609910, 504904, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great triptych of a subject thats been photographed to death.  Nice crisp exposure on Lincoln, nice detail and processing on the corner of the memorial, and wonderful detail shot on his hand.  Three distinct images, each of which stands on its own but together make a nice illustration of your subject.  Good job! 8</td>', 'Great triptych of a subject thats been photographed to death.  Nice crisp exposure on Lincoln, nice detail and processing on the corner of the memorial, and wonderful detail shot on his hand.  Three distinct images, each of which stands on its own but together make a nice illustration of your subject.  Good job! 8', '2007-05-03 10:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609913, 503496, 70270, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of triptych format on a single image -- each panel could stand on its own, and the whole is greater than the parts</td>', 'Very nice use of triptych format on a single image -- each panel could stand on its own, and the whole is greater than the parts', '2007-05-03 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609915, 504753, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice use of forms ... individually the pictures are just ok, but together they are fabulous.</td>', 'Nice use of forms ... individually the pictures are just ok, but together they are fabulous.', '2007-05-03 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609916, 504594, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones and good contrast; I like the arrangement and the variety of poses.</td>', 'Nice range of tones and good contrast; I like the arrangement and the variety of poses.', '2007-05-03 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609917, 505110, 70270, '<td valign="top">Poor choice of subject on the far left, but other than that very nice images and triptych.  (I was gonna vote you down for using the Dodgers, but I''ll just let the Giants take care of that on the field.  ;&gt;P)</td>', 'Poor choice of subject on the far left, but other than that very nice images and triptych.  (I was gonna vote you down for using the Dodgers, but I''ll just let the Giants take care of that on the field.  ;>P)', '2007-05-03 10:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609923, 504652, 61651, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this - it may not be a "sexy" image with lots of bright colors, so I guess you might not do well in the voting, but this is a creative take on perspective and you joined up the 3 images very well. 9</td>', 'I love the perspective on this - it may not be a "sexy" image with lots of bright colors, so I guess you might not do well in the voting, but this is a creative take on perspective and you joined up the 3 images very well. 9', '2007-05-03 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
