(3612479, 504117, 67883, '<td valign="top">The blue color is terrible, the stitching is just terribly distracting and there is no way to look at this photograph at all.</td>', 'The blue color is terrible, the stitching is just terribly distracting and there is no way to look at this photograph at all.', '2007-05-03 22:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612484, 504872, 67883, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t it supposed to be three? Still nice picture.. would have liked to see more diversity.</td>', 'Wasn''t it supposed to be three? Still nice picture.. would have liked to see more diversity.', '2007-05-03 22:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612565, 504595, 47852, '<td valign="top">I love how the shots are seemlessly put together and the light flows.  I also like how the trees to the left are fuller, and the ones to the right are more bare... almost as if it is a change in season as it goes across the shot too.  My only little nitpick is that the shot feels tilted down to the right.  Overall, great idea and well excecuted.</td>', 'I love how the shots are seemlessly put together and the light flows.  I also like how the trees to the left are fuller, and the ones to the right are more bare... almost as if it is a change in season as it goes across the shot too.  My only little nitpick is that the shot feels tilted down to the right.  Overall, great idea and well excecuted.', '2007-05-03 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612566, 504927, 47852, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the story this one tells.  Something that a mom would be proud to display on her wall.  The dandelion stem she''s holding onto is a nice touch too.  You can just see the child bringing it to her as if it was the best thing in the world!  Lovely!</td>', 'Absolutely love the story this one tells.  Something that a mom would be proud to display on her wall.  The dandelion stem she''s holding onto is a nice touch too.  You can just see the child bringing it to her as if it was the best thing in the world!  Lovely!', '2007-05-03 22:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612567, 504322, 47852, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is wonderful!  Love how you kept to a theme, yet there are different colors, patterns and textures.  Sometimes simple is better! :)</td>', 'Oh, this is wonderful!  Love how you kept to a theme, yet there are different colors, patterns and textures.  Sometimes simple is better! :)', '2007-05-03 22:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612662, 504469, 57882, '<td valign="top">Would make a great "ad".</td>', 'Would make a great "ad".', '2007-05-03 22:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612669, 504601, 57882, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  A little blurry though.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  A little blurry though.', '2007-05-03 22:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612754, 504117, 19944, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  The blue is just way too much.  If it had been white and maybe a little thinner, I would have liked this a lot more.</td>', 'Oh my.  The blue is just way too much.  If it had been white and maybe a little thinner, I would have liked this a lot more.', '2007-05-03 23:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612815, 504531, 61961, '<td valign="top">The subject really makes this one for me.  Really lovely, and there''s a slight softness that works with the subject.  I love how the elbows (with two skin tones) make an abstract out of the first panel!</td>', 'The subject really makes this one for me.  Really lovely, and there''s a slight softness that works with the subject.  I love how the elbows (with two skin tones) make an abstract out of the first panel!', '2007-05-03 23:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
