(3615295, 505049, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Duck butts!  (Took me a minute.  I like the series - like the orange thingie in the first grame and the reflections in all the frames.  And I get a kick out of the duck butts.</td>', 'LOL!  Duck butts!  (Took me a minute.  I like the series - like the orange thingie in the first grame and the reflections in all the frames.  And I get a kick out of the duck butts.', '2007-05-04 15:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
