(3615474, 504601, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good idea for the challenge but missing a bit in clarity.  Good color, good clean background.</td>', 'Very good idea for the challenge but missing a bit in clarity.  Good color, good clean background.', '2007-05-04 16:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
