(3615591, 502380, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know, I like this, but I don''t like it as a triptych - I''d pefer it as a single shot.  I can''t know if you took it at three different times, so perhaps it wasn''t possible as a single shot (and that''s not the challenge anyway).  Maybe other thank white as the divisors... Still, great place to shoot, like the three very different riders captured, and great light.</td>', 'You know, I like this, but I don''t like it as a triptych - I''d pefer it as a single shot.  I can''t know if you took it at three different times, so perhaps it wasn''t possible as a single shot (and that''s not the challenge anyway).  Maybe other thank white as the divisors... Still, great place to shoot, like the three very different riders captured, and great light.', '2007-05-04 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615661, 504342, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice layout and the border is pleasing. Great photographs and presented well.</td>', 'Very nice layout and the border is pleasing. Great photographs and presented well.', '2007-05-04 17:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
