(3615902, 504927, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very good subject for a story board in this medium.<br/>I only wish the upper left image were sized the same as the right side to affect a better balance, and the lower image was centered in the outer frame.</td>', 'Very good subject for a story board in this medium.I only wish the upper left image were sized the same as the right side to affect a better balance, and the lower image was centered in the outer frame.', '2007-05-04 18:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
