(3616320, 503496, 20330, '<td valign="top">i like this shot.. and since there are so many great shots in this challenge, i find myself looking for flaws.. the only flaw i feel here is the shadow of the frames.. i think the frames being closer together would have more impact. 7</td>', 'i like this shot.. and since there are so many great shots in this challenge, i find myself looking for flaws.. the only flaw i feel here is the shadow of the frames.. i think the frames being closer together would have more impact. 7', '2007-05-04 21:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
