(3616368, 504050, 51793, '<td valign="top">Here is a good example of a Triptych. The faded 3 primary colors really make this picture stand out beyond all the rest. There are a few things that you could do to inprove this image. <br/> <br/>1. Lower the drop shadow effect some. It''s over powering the images. <br/>2. Show more of your subjects. I think they are bit dark for a color image but would make it stand out in a B&amp;W. So lighten up your images some. <br/> <br/>I really like the background you have used here. I don''t know what you did or what you used but I would like to know.</td>', 'Here is a good example of a Triptych. The faded 3 primary colors really make this picture stand out beyond all the rest. There are a few things that you could do to inprove this image.  1. Lower the drop shadow effect some. It''s over powering the images. 2. Show more of your subjects. I think they are bit dark for a color image but would make it stand out in a B&W. So lighten up your images some.  I really like the background you have used here. I don''t know what you did or what you used but I would like to know.', '2007-05-04 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
