(3622763, 504799, 31534, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>First Impression was interesting shotm but no WOW factor<br/> <br/>Technically <br/>All the shots are in focus and the lighting is good.<br/> <br/>Composition.. I like shots one and three but the middle shot needed a closer crop. The pile of dirt in the middle picture is distracting<br/> <br/>Meets Challenge<br/>Yes<br/> <br/>Final Thoughts.<br/> <br/>After reading the comments I am really impressed about what this is all about and how it is used, how I wish we would find some cleaner solutions here in America. <br/> <br/>Over all this is a decent shot. Maybe some different angles could make this more interesting<br/> <br/>Best of Luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Karen <br/> <br/>Best of luck in future challenges<br/>Karen</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club First Impression was interesting shotm but no WOW factor Technically All the shots are in focus and the lighting is good. Composition.. I like shots one and three but the middle shot needed a closer crop. The pile of dirt in the middle picture is distracting Meets ChallengeYes Final Thoughts. After reading the comments I am really impressed about what this is all about and how it is used, how I wish we would find some cleaner solutions here in America.  Over all this is a decent shot. Maybe some different angles could make this more interesting Best of Luck in future challenges. Karen  Best of luck in future challengesKaren', '2007-05-07 01:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
