(3622784, 505102, 28742, '<td valign="top">The technicals are all excellent. The half desat works well. Frankly though, it looks like a cover for a horror flick or book. The title alludes to some public awareness of domestic abuse, but the image is way over the top of that message and doesn''t fit well, IMO. My guess is that if you had a title like "Til Death Do We Part!" or something Hollywoodish or dramatic, it would have increased your score by .0281<br/> <br/>As for the makeup and realism - I think you did a decent job on all counts including the use of the white tank top, aka "Wifebeater Shirt"<br/> <br/>Hope that helps. :)</td>', 'The technicals are all excellent. The half desat works well. Frankly though, it looks like a cover for a horror flick or book. The title alludes to some public awareness of domestic abuse, but the image is way over the top of that message and doesn''t fit well, IMO. My guess is that if you had a title like "Til Death Do We Part!" or something Hollywoodish or dramatic, it would have increased your score by .0281 As for the makeup and realism - I think you did a decent job on all counts including the use of the white tank top, aka "Wifebeater Shirt" Hope that helps. :)', '2007-05-07 01:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
