(3622877, 503635, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot - tells a great story on its own, but your words add so much.  Thanks for sharing this.</td>', 'Great shot - tells a great story on its own, but your words add so much.  Thanks for sharing this.', '2007-05-07 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
