(3622943, 504222, 31534, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>First Impression was WOW I wouldn''t want flames that close to my hair.. <br/> <br/>Technically <br/>I like the lighting, and the one you shot of the violinist inside was the best of the three. <br/> <br/>Composition.. <br/>I like the set up of the pictures, it brought to mind Nero playing while Rome burned. <br/> <br/>Meets Challenge<br/>Yes<br/> <br/>Final Thoughts.<br/>A great change from the flower shots.. (I entered a bad flower shot)<br/>I agree with the person who said the violin shot could stand alone. <br/>Nice entry. Really should have scored higher. <br/> <br/>Best of Luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Karen</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club First Impression was WOW I wouldn''t want flames that close to my hair..  Technically I like the lighting, and the one you shot of the violinist inside was the best of the three.  Composition.. I like the set up of the pictures, it brought to mind Nero playing while Rome burned.  Meets ChallengeYes Final Thoughts.A great change from the flower shots.. (I entered a bad flower shot)I agree with the person who said the violin shot could stand alone. Nice entry. Really should have scored higher.  Best of Luck in future challenges. Karen', '2007-05-07 02:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
