(3622950, 505102, 66515, '<td valign="top">I have to kinda agree with Art. If you''d gone with a title that might have fit with old pulp fiction or a B movie it would be less offensive (which would have knocked off a few ones and twos) and more macabre. <br/> <br/>That aside I like the series and the bottom frame really ties the three shots together really well. <br/> <br/>This series kinda reminds me almost of the scene in the first Evil Dead where Ash has to kill Linda.</td>', 'I have to kinda agree with Art. If you''d gone with a title that might have fit with old pulp fiction or a B movie it would be less offensive (which would have knocked off a few ones and twos) and more macabre.  That aside I like the series and the bottom frame really ties the three shots together really well.  This series kinda reminds me almost of the scene in the first Evil Dead where Ash has to kill Linda.', '2007-05-07 02:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
