(3623113, 505102, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think maybe a different, "horror movie" title like people are suggesting might have given you a slightly better score, but I''m glad that you titled it what you did.  Makes us think more.</td>', 'I think maybe a different, "horror movie" title like people are suggesting might have given you a slightly better score, but I''m glad that you titled it what you did.  Makes us think more.', '2007-05-07 03:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
