(3623119, 504150, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red, Jason! Glad you kept the ladybug alive :)</td>', 'Congrats on the red, Jason! Glad you kept the ladybug alive :)', '2007-05-07 03:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3623120, 504710, 53316, '<td valign="top">-Critique Club-<br/> <br/>I love the angle that you used.  Very unique and dramatic. I do not feel that anything is missing at all because there is no head (which is unusual, and congrats on that).<br/> <br/>Lighting is pretty nice however I think a bluer sky would have been nicer. This can be done in post processing in advanced. Also the trees are sort of distracting to me.  <br/> <br/>I feel that the main thing that hurt this was the large amount of background/frame. Making the two smaller pictures somewhat larger, perhaps at the bottom or top of the larger picture, would have allowed us to view the subject better.  The large amount of background space being gray also helps to underscore the gray of the sky, so maybe a nice red to match the instrument would have been better.<br/> <br/>Overall, nice image and great clarity of subject, just maybe could be more "wow" given some improvements.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-07 02:48:36.</i></td>', '-Critique Club- I love the angle that you used.  Very unique and dramatic. I do not feel that anything is missing at all because there is no head (which is unusual, and congrats on that). Lighting is pretty nice however I think a bluer sky would have been nicer. This can be done in post processing in advanced. Also the trees are sort of distracting to me.   I feel that the main thing that hurt this was the large amount of background/frame. Making the two smaller pictures somewhat larger, perhaps at the bottom or top of the larger picture, would have allowed us to view the subject better.  The large amount of background space being gray also helps to underscore the gray of the sky, so maybe a nice red to match the instrument would have been better. Overall, nice image and great clarity of subject, just maybe could be more "wow" given some improvements.', '2007-05-07 03:47:26.000000', '2007-05-07 03:48:36.000000', 0),
(3623122, 503399, 49109, '<td valign="top">Very well done, congrats on the yellow!</td>', 'Very well done, congrats on the yellow!', '2007-05-07 03:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
