(3623281, 504951, 62095, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this one but I think it would have made a seven from me.  If I had to nitpick at a detail then it would be the way the shadow is falling across the back of her leg in the centre shot. Otherwise fun and dynamic, good use of the trip.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this one but I think it would have made a seven from me.  If I had to nitpick at a detail then it would be the way the shadow is falling across the back of her leg in the centre shot. Otherwise fun and dynamic, good use of the trip.', '2007-05-07 06:04:51.000000', NULL, 0),
