(3623721, 504587, 30982, '<td valign="top">There are the green shoes, the new green growth, the green jacket on the baby, but moreso, there''s the new growth, the pregnant woman, and the baby.  Whether or not any of that is intended.... well that''s another story - but that''s the story I see.</td>', 'There are the green shoes, the new green growth, the green jacket on the baby, but moreso, there''s the new growth, the pregnant woman, and the baby.  Whether or not any of that is intended.... well that''s another story - but that''s the story I see.', '2007-05-07 10:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
