(3623781, 504222, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has a tremendous energy and vibrance to it - makes a great composite!  I, too, think the one of the violin can stand on it''s own - heck all three can!  Very unique and enjoyable entry.</td>', 'This has a tremendous energy and vibrance to it - makes a great composite!  I, too, think the one of the violin can stand on it''s own - heck all three can!  Very unique and enjoyable entry.', '2007-05-07 10:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
