(3623793, 504737, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m really surprised this didn''t score higher. I think the b&amp;w is very effective. The triptych has a point to make, and does it well. I haven''t read the other comments, but maybe the focus/noise/quality of the shots hurt. Also, I''m wondering if there might have been a way to arrange the shots so that the leg wasn''t cut off in the center image.<br/> <br/>edit for typos.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-07 09:43:52.</i></td>', 'I''m really surprised this didn''t score higher. I think the b&w is very effective. The triptych has a point to make, and does it well. I haven''t read the other comments, but maybe the focus/noise/quality of the shots hurt. Also, I''m wondering if there might have been a way to arrange the shots so that the leg wasn''t cut off in the center image. edit for typos.', '2007-05-07 10:40:47.000000', '2007-05-07 10:43:52.000000', 0),
(3623803, 504192, 70661, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract feel and I love the colors!</td>', 'Very nice abstract feel and I love the colors!', '2007-05-07 10:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
