(3626389, 504604, 45475, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, my son likes to sit beside me when I''m voting. When he saw this one, he got the whole single crack theme instantly. He''s 7 1/2. I got it when he jumped up and ran his finger across the screen, saying "See? Coooool...". I''m back here now, looking for the 5th image ;)</td>', 'Sometimes, my son likes to sit beside me when I''m voting. When he saw this one, he got the whole single crack theme instantly. He''s 7 1/2. I got it when he jumped up and ran his finger across the screen, saying "See? Coooool...". I''m back here now, looking for the 5th image ;)', '2007-05-07 22:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
