(3628710, 505023, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hey Jeb, I gave you a 6 in the challenge. Also what levyj413 says is correct it doesn''t have to be a progression. Now while I love the theme one of the photos just seems to be out of place. The one on the top left isn''t the same car. Which is fine, if you would have done different cars for each frame. Or you could have made them all the same cars with different aspects. I don''t know for sure, I''ve never done a triptych. Still I like the theme and I think they are well done technically.</td>', 'Hey Jeb, I gave you a 6 in the challenge. Also what levyj413 says is correct it doesn''t have to be a progression. Now while I love the theme one of the photos just seems to be out of place. The one on the top left isn''t the same car. Which is fine, if you would have done different cars for each frame. Or you could have made them all the same cars with different aspects. I don''t know for sure, I''ve never done a triptych. Still I like the theme and I think they are well done technically.', '2007-05-08 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
