(3643649, 503410, 39243, '<td valign="top">OK - I have been very busy so it took me a while to check the results. <br/> <br/>First - I need to apologize to all those who took time to give me feedback even though many didn''t get that I was trying for this look for the photo. I think its great that people offered constructive crit and didn''t just slam me. I had a ton of fun with this photo and couldn''t be happier with the results.  <br/> <br/>I would like to thank the people like larryslights who got my reference.<br/> <br/>Whooohooo! my first brown! hehe<br/> <br/>Just so ya''ll know I didn''t put framing around each section on purpose. but there are three separate photos if you can stand it long enough to look at it. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-13 02:56:05.</i></td>', 'OK - I have been very busy so it took me a while to check the results.  First - I need to apologize to all those who took time to give me feedback even though many didn''t get that I was trying for this look for the photo. I think its great that people offered constructive crit and didn''t just slam me. I had a ton of fun with this photo and couldn''t be happier with the results.   I would like to thank the people like larryslights who got my reference. Whooohooo! my first brown! hehe Just so ya''ll know I didn''t put framing around each section on purpose. but there are three separate photos if you can stand it long enough to look at it. ', '2007-05-13 03:51:25.000000', '2007-05-13 03:56:05.000000', 0),
