(3673312, 504814, 62787, '<td valign="top">Such lovely pictures :)<br/> <br/>Basically, I agree with the general consensus - the background picture doesn''t jump out enough because of the desaturation. <br/>I think it would''ve been interesting to try and do very different pp on the 3 pictures - have one conventional, sharp one with bright colours, make one of them B&amp;W or duotone of some sort, and totally overprocess one and make it burst with colour.<br/> <br/>It''s still cute as it is though - well done.</td>', 'Such lovely pictures :) Basically, I agree with the general consensus - the background picture doesn''t jump out enough because of the desaturation. I think it would''ve been interesting to try and do very different pp on the 3 pictures - have one conventional, sharp one with bright colours, make one of them B&W or duotone of some sort, and totally overprocess one and make it burst with colour. It''s still cute as it is though - well done.', '2007-05-21 09:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
