(3712343, 504474, 50034, '<td valign="top">Considering the fact that you are not shy about self-portraits, I humbly submit that this could be a consistent reaction that you get from all men...<b>Flipping Head Over Heels!</b>  :}<br/> <br/>Oh, by the way, Is that your picture being used by Merriam Webster &amp; Company to illustrate the term, "<b>Ageless</b>?"<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a <b>sparkling career</b> thus far as <i>both photographer and model!</i>  :)</td>', 'Considering the fact that you are not shy about self-portraits, I humbly submit that this could be a consistent reaction that you get from all men...Flipping Head Over Heels!  :} Oh, by the way, Is that your picture being used by Merriam Webster & Company to illustrate the term, "Ageless?" Congratulations on a sparkling career thus far as both photographer and model!  :)', '2007-05-30 01:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
