(3862822, 505111, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very unique and interesting...  I love all the thrilling contrasts.</td>', 'Very unique and interesting...  I love all the thrilling contrasts.', '2007-07-03 12:27:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867955, 504150, 49865, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe I haven''t commented on this yet. I stumbled upon it a while ago and loved it, and find myself revisiting it now. Kudos to the vigilance and determination with which you approached this project, that last frame is really amazing. I love how the focus remains on the grass and the ladybug has escaped the narrow focus into a blur.</td>', 'Can''t believe I haven''t commented on this yet. I stumbled upon it a while ago and loved it, and find myself revisiting it now. Kudos to the vigilance and determination with which you approached this project, that last frame is really amazing. I love how the focus remains on the grass and the ladybug has escaped the narrow focus into a blur.', '2007-07-04 15:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3873012, 503954, 49804, '<td valign="top">Great idea, 3 really great shots put together, favorited</td>', 'Great idea, 3 really great shots put together, favorited', '2007-07-05 19:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3875881, 504708, 75893, '<td valign="top">This is such an amazing collection of photos, breathtaking!</td>', 'This is such an amazing collection of photos, breathtaking!', '2007-07-06 16:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3899186, 504150, 80588, '<td valign="top">AMAZING! I have tried to capture these guys a few times! VERY DIFFICULT indeed! Do you ALWAYS use a tripod with your macro? I have been lectured TO DEATH about using a tripod! I want to hand hold, LOL! Could be why most of my shots are a blurry mess!<br/>LOVE this!</td>', 'AMAZING! I have tried to capture these guys a few times! VERY DIFFICULT indeed! Do you ALWAYS use a tripod with your macro? I have been lectured TO DEATH about using a tripod! I want to hand hold, LOL! Could be why most of my shots are a blurry mess!LOVE this!', '2007-07-12 22:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
